(963535, 113363, 6172, '<td valign="top">Though I''m sure you took this at night, and I''m not counting off for it - I''m also sure you''re getting lots of comments on how this really isn''t obviously a night shot- it almost looks like daylight.    You show some great creativity on this shot.</td>', 'Though I''m sure you took this at night, and I''m not counting off for it - I''m also sure you''re getting lots of comments on how this really isn''t obviously a night shot- it almost looks like daylight.    You show some great creativity on this shot.', '2004-10-18 06:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(963536, 112773, 27524, '<td valign="top">Thats different night shoot for sure... I like the idea...but compozition could have been different. Its too much of the ground for my taste... could take at higher point and more right... there would be nice view on street going further. But its good shot and i like colors of it.</td>', 'Thats different night shoot for sure... I like the idea...but compozition could have been different. Its too much of the ground for my taste... could take at higher point and more right... there would be nice view on street going further. But its good shot and i like colors of it.', '2004-10-18 06:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(963537, 113604, 27524, '<td valign="top">Great... good focus...rich colors... nice compoziton. Good luck.</td>', 'Great... good focus...rich colors... nice compoziton. Good luck.', '2004-10-18 06:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
