(963549, 113349, 3724, '<td valign="top">Black lite lit bowling emporium.........  Does the galaxy bowl actually look any different at noon?   I never took an opportunity to go bowling but if I did I think it would be at night.   A good document and well made.</td>', 'Black lite lit bowling emporium.........  Does the galaxy bowl actually look any different at noon?   I never took an opportunity to go bowling but if I did I think it would be at night.   A good document and well made.', '2004-10-18 07:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
