(963604, 113647, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is quite lovely - the shades of purple / violet are very pleasing, and the lighting is nicely effective.  the damp on the stone steps is a bit of a distraction, and one can''t help but expect to see a knight in shining armour somewhere in the vicinity of the frame.  but all told, it''s a stylish and atmospheric picture.  7.</td>', 'this is quite lovely - the shades of purple / violet are very pleasing, and the lighting is nicely effective.  the damp on the stone steps is a bit of a distraction, and one can''t help but expect to see a knight in shining armour somewhere in the vicinity of the frame.  but all told, it''s a stylish and atmospheric picture.  7.', '2004-10-18 08:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(963605, 113561, 6532, '<td valign="top">This was one of my ideas...check out my portfolio.  I like the border you used.  Seems like there is a bit of noise in this shot.  Maybe to lower the ISO would have been helpful....good composition.</td>', 'This was one of my ideas...check out my portfolio.  I like the border you used.  Seems like there is a bit of noise in this shot.  Maybe to lower the ISO would have been helpful....good composition.', '2004-10-18 08:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
