(963633, 113127, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and crispness.  Composition is not bad either - smiles.  Good job. Top vote from me.</td>', 'Great clarity and crispness.  Composition is not bad either - smiles.  Good job. Top vote from me.', '2004-10-18 09:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(963634, 113327, 6532, '<td valign="top">Composition is awesome!  The only thing I do not like is the thick solid border -and I am one who likes borders.  I think a thin white line would have broken up the solid border nicely.  Still a top pick...</td>', 'Composition is awesome!  The only thing I do not like is the thick solid border -and I am one who likes borders.  I think a thin white line would have broken up the solid border nicely.  Still a top pick...', '2004-10-18 09:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(963635, 113141, 6532, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors!!!  Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome colors!!!  Very nice.', '2004-10-18 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(963637, 113398, 6532, '<td valign="top">It is not a blue beetle...its a blue beetle and another car.... the halo rings are very distracting.  There are so many ways that this shot could have been done better....I do like the use of thirds.</td>', 'It is not a blue beetle...its a blue beetle and another car.... the halo rings are very distracting.  There are so many ways that this shot could have been done better....I do like the use of thirds.', '2004-10-18 09:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(963638, 113691, 6532, '<td valign="top">How do I know this was after the sun went down?  It could have been in the middle of the day.</td>', 'How do I know this was after the sun went down?  It could have been in the middle of the day.', '2004-10-18 09:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(963670, 113348, 13365, '<td valign="top">This shot is so badass! I love the colors and comp. Im taking a guess that this Anime2k? Only one I know with a carmount. If it isnt, great job!! My fav of the challenge and this should be the blue!!!! 10</td>', 'This shot is so badass! I love the colors and comp. Im taking a guess that this Anime2k? Only one I know with a carmount. If it isnt, great job!! My fav of the challenge and this should be the blue!!!! 10', '2004-10-18 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(963674, 113536, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice use of sepia here.  I like the urban feel of the shot, and the near absense of people.  i find the glare on the street lights a little over powering - not sure how to avoid that really as i guess a shorter exposure time might make the overall final result very dark.  but it''s a very likeable shot that screams nice Continental European town to me.  7.</td>', 'nice use of sepia here.  I like the urban feel of the shot, and the near absense of people.  i find the glare on the street lights a little over powering - not sure how to avoid that really as i guess a shorter exposure time might make the overall final result very dark.  but it''s a very likeable shot that screams nice Continental European town to me.  7.', '2004-10-18 10:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(963675, 113507, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a total mess and i love it!  i must confess, you''re very brave for posting this type of shot here, and go you for damning the consequences!  the excessive movement makes it clear it was intentional, and i think it works well.  the colours are bold and bright, and creates a definite impact.  I think it is let down by the (over exposed) white sign in the left third of the frame - it kind of gives away too much about your movement and kind of disrupts the pattern you''ve got going in the rest of the picture.  good shot, though - 8.</td>', 'it''s a total mess and i love it!  i must confess, you''re very brave for posting this type of shot here, and go you for damning the consequences!  the excessive movement makes it clear it was intentional, and i think it works well.  the colours are bold and bright, and creates a definite impact.  I think it is let down by the (over exposed) white sign in the left third of the frame - it kind of gives away too much about your movement and kind of disrupts the pattern you''ve got going in the rest of the picture.  good shot, though - 8.', '2004-10-18 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(963676, 113618, 16004, '<td valign="top">the water does certainly add to the fairly uninspiring skyline - i think it was right to focus the viewers attention by way of the title (example of clever titling there).  i might have cropped a little tighter top and bottom, losing some sky and the ripply portions of the water (the smooth bits are lovely).  the skyline does let you down a bit, though - too undefined, dark and a bit weird around the buildings... a solid place to rest your camera and an even longer exposure time might have worked...  5.</td>', 'the water does certainly add to the fairly uninspiring skyline - i think it was right to focus the viewers attention by way of the title (example of clever titling there).  i might have cropped a little tighter top and bottom, losing some sky and the ripply portions of the water (the smooth bits are lovely).  the skyline does let you down a bit, though - too undefined, dark and a bit weird around the buildings... a solid place to rest your camera and an even longer exposure time might have worked...  5.', '2004-10-18 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(963677, 113305, 1368, '<td valign="top">christmas lights? :o</td>', 'christmas lights? :o', '2004-10-18 10:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(963679, 112357, 16004, '<td valign="top">fantastic.  10.  totally beautiful and i am left utterly speechless.  very very very excellent</td>', 'fantastic.  10.  totally beautiful and i am left utterly speechless.  very very very excellent', '2004-10-18 10:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(963686, 112357, 16493, '<td valign="top">The hill at the bottom is a bit destracting, I wold try to clone it out or crop it away.</td>', 'The hill at the bottom is a bit destracting, I wold try to clone it out or crop it away.', '2004-10-18 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(963692, 113373, 10390, '<td valign="top">This photo lacks a person, maybe a biker or something on the path, the lightposts distracts, but what could you have done about that?!  Otherwise it''s well composed and the lighting is good.</td>', 'This photo lacks a person, maybe a biker or something on the path, the lightposts distracts, but what could you have done about that?!  Otherwise it''s well composed and the lighting is good.', '2004-10-18 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
