(963717, 113652, 10390, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing clouds, I really like the movement of the clouds, I''m a huge clouds fan.  I think that you should have placed the lighthouse more to the right, it''s too centered like that for my taste.  Otherwise this is a good photo and the clouds... wow!</td>', 'Wow, amazing clouds, I really like the movement of the clouds, I''m a huge clouds fan.  I think that you should have placed the lighthouse more to the right, it''s too centered like that for my taste.  Otherwise this is a good photo and the clouds... wow!', '2004-10-18 11:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
