(963723, 113225, 19952, '<td valign="top">You picked a nice subject to shoot and framed it well, but I''m not sure about that green caste over the whole image. The windows are full of color, but some adjustment of colors or curves might give the rest of the image a truer color, assuming this church isn''t actually green. :-)</td>', 'You picked a nice subject to shoot and framed it well, but I''m not sure about that green caste over the whole image. The windows are full of color, but some adjustment of colors or curves might give the rest of the image a truer color, assuming this church isn''t actually green. :-)', '2004-10-18 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(963726, 113366, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really cool lighting in this photo. The clear stars behind the brightly lit crane make this shot look almost surreal. Very nice job!</td>', 'Really cool lighting in this photo. The clear stars behind the brightly lit crane make this shot look almost surreal. Very nice job!', '2004-10-18 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
