(963729, 113533, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful movement ...</td>', 'Beautiful movement ...', '2004-10-18 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(963730, 113115, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful shot of the city - one of the best I''ve ever seen. The purple color of the sky seems a bit unusual, so I think it might look better in grey tones to let the lights of the city stand out. But that''s a small point - this is a really excellent photo. Great job!</td>', 'This is a really beautiful shot of the city - one of the best I''ve ever seen. The purple color of the sky seems a bit unusual, so I think it might look better in grey tones to let the lights of the city stand out. But that''s a small point - this is a really excellent photo. Great job!', '2004-10-18 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
