(963732, 113672, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A spy''s paradise.</td>', 'Wow.  A spy''s paradise.', '2004-10-18 11:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(963734, 113652, 12962, '<td valign="top">The movement of the clouds is so eerie ... very ethereal feeling like in a dream sequence of a movie.  Good job! 10.</td>', 'The movement of the clouds is so eerie ... very ethereal feeling like in a dream sequence of a movie.  Good job! 10.', '2004-10-18 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(963737, 112937, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and framing in this photo. I do think it''s a bit busy, so it might look better if you were closer to the building to eliminate all those foreground items from the shot. Still, this is a really nice photo - good job.</td>', 'I really like the subject and framing in this photo. I do think it''s a bit busy, so it might look better if you were closer to the building to eliminate all those foreground items from the shot. Still, this is a really nice photo - good job.', '2004-10-18 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(963739, 113167, 22533, '<td valign="top">Wow, I predict a ribbon with this one. Great color, sharpness.</td>', 'Wow, I predict a ribbon with this one. Great color, sharpness.', '2004-10-18 11:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963740, 113495, 19952, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of exposure in this shot. The composition is divided beautifully into thirds and the lights and colors really stand out against the sky and water. Great job!</td>', 'Excellent job of exposure in this shot. The composition is divided beautifully into thirds and the lights and colors really stand out against the sky and water. Great job!', '2004-10-18 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(963742, 113559, 18219, '<td valign="top">interesting angle and nice silhouette.<br/>but I''m not too keen on the purple sky.</td>', 'interesting angle and nice silhouette.but I''m not too keen on the purple sky.', '2004-10-18 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(963743, 113263, 22533, '<td valign="top">Now that''s cool. Nice work.</td>', 'Now that''s cool. Nice work.', '2004-10-18 11:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(963744, 113599, 18219, '<td valign="top">the green arrow is very good!<br/>but the stuff in the background is unclear and distracting.<br/>i think the traffic light on it''s own would have been better.</td>', 'the green arrow is very good!but the stuff in the background is unclear and distracting.i think the traffic light on it''s own would have been better.', '2004-10-18 12:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(963745, 113348, 18219, '<td valign="top">crisp clear cool colors</td>', 'crisp clear cool colors', '2004-10-18 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(963746, 113362, 18219, '<td valign="top">apart from the washed out top right corner, a good image.</td>', 'apart from the washed out top right corner, a good image.', '2004-10-18 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(963748, 113195, 18219, '<td valign="top">a good idea, but it doesn''t look like smoke around the man.</td>', 'a good idea, but it doesn''t look like smoke around the man.', '2004-10-18 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(963750, 113670, 18219, '<td valign="top">looks like an interesting concept, but it''s hard to find something to focus on to see what is going on in the picture.</td>', 'looks like an interesting concept, but it''s hard to find something to focus on to see what is going on in the picture.', '2004-10-18 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(963751, 113440, 21245, '<td valign="top">oooo, I love the Salt Lake temple, it''s a brilliant choice for photography, I hope there''s an other night challenge around the holidays, so you can get it with all the lights.  I wish that large structure wasn''t in the way though, it''s kind of obstructive.</td>', 'oooo, I love the Salt Lake temple, it''s a brilliant choice for photography, I hope there''s an other night challenge around the holidays, so you can get it with all the lights.  I wish that large structure wasn''t in the way though, it''s kind of obstructive.', '2004-10-18 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(963752, 113433, 16004, '<td valign="top">And respect to you for fighting the temptation to rotate the camera 90 degrees to do a portrait orientated shot.  the use of negative space certainly works in terms of composition.  the colours are wonderfully rich, the brickwork contrasting well with the purply sky.  I think the street lamp is a bit unwanted - kind of mucks about with the scale of the church making it seemingly less impressive.  can''t decide if i like the border - in terms of presentation it''s a bit like one of those paintings with the picture flowing over and into the frame, an effect which i never liked much.  it is a nice picture, gorgeous building and lovely sky...  7.</td>', 'And respect to you for fighting the temptation to rotate the camera 90 degrees to do a portrait orientated shot.  the use of negative space certainly works in terms of composition.  the colours are wonderfully rich, the brickwork contrasting well with the purply sky.  I think the street lamp is a bit unwanted - kind of mucks about with the scale of the church making it seemingly less impressive.  can''t decide if i like the border - in terms of presentation it''s a bit like one of those paintings with the picture flowing over and into the frame, an effect which i never liked much.  it is a nice picture, gorgeous building and lovely sky...  7.', '2004-10-18 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(963755, 113429, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great location for this photo and a nice shot for this challenge. I think you could have captured the reflection just as well without so much overexosure, so you might want to take more shots around this area with a bit less ISO or lower shutter time. But the composition is really nice and you sure picked a great subject to shoot.</td>', 'This is a great location for this photo and a nice shot for this challenge. I think you could have captured the reflection just as well without so much overexosure, so you might want to take more shots around this area with a bit less ISO or lower shutter time. But the composition is really nice and you sure picked a great subject to shoot.', '2004-10-18 12:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(963771, 112694, 16266, '<td valign="top">i would like the image a little darker, I don''t see any pitch black.</td>', 'i would like the image a little darker, I don''t see any pitch black.', '2004-10-18 12:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(963773, 113702, 16266, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Good composition.</td>', 'Nice image.  Good composition.', '2004-10-18 12:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(963775, 113559, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image.  A great caputre of the building in the background, and good use of framing.</td>', 'nice image.  A great caputre of the building in the background, and good use of framing.', '2004-10-18 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(963777, 113504, 16266, '<td valign="top">great green.  nice image.</td>', 'great green.  nice image.', '2004-10-18 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(963778, 113634, 16266, '<td valign="top">this image is very nice and moody.  I like it... not sure why it is so blurry on the edges... perhaps your doing. perhaps foggy lens??.. doesn''t hurt the image though.</td>', 'this image is very nice and moody.  I like it... not sure why it is so blurry on the edges... perhaps your doing. perhaps foggy lens??.. doesn''t hurt the image though.', '2004-10-18 12:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(963780, 112717, 16266, '<td valign="top">Great colors and sharpness.  I don''t get a feeling of escape.. it looks the the individual is going very slowly down the stairs or is stopped.  Perhaps if there was motion blur... in any case really nice image... don''t particularly like the title.</td>', 'Great colors and sharpness.  I don''t get a feeling of escape.. it looks the the individual is going very slowly down the stairs or is stopped.  Perhaps if there was motion blur... in any case really nice image... don''t particularly like the title.', '2004-10-18 12:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(963781, 113167, 16266, '<td valign="top">great reflection... nice image.. i like the colors and light.. how the reflection merges into the background.  I have been recently really intrigued by reflections.  Great image.  perhaps i would like to see it a ''touch'' darker, or more contrast to get some blacks in the image.</td>', 'great reflection... nice image.. i like the colors and light.. how the reflection merges into the background.  I have been recently really intrigued by reflections.  Great image.  perhaps i would like to see it a ''touch'' darker, or more contrast to get some blacks in the image.', '2004-10-18 12:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(963783, 113127, 22781, '<td valign="top">Whooaaw, I submitted a bridge too, and I''m not complaing about how it''s doing, not at all... But this is so much better...<br/></td>', 'Whooaaw, I submitted a bridge too, and I''m not complaing about how it''s doing, not at all... But this is so much better...', '2004-10-18 12:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(963786, 113366, 16266, '<td valign="top">i think this could have been really great, but it seems way too over saturated.</td>', 'i think this could have been really great, but it seems way too over saturated.', '2004-10-18 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(963795, 113582, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is realy unfair...<br/>How can we compete with a shot like that?<br/>Congrats... 10</td>', 'This is realy unfair...How can we compete with a shot like that?Congrats... 10', '2004-10-18 12:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(963796, 113600, 16266, '<td valign="top">perhaps the tree''s were moving.. perhaps you liked the sort of abstract look, .. it is a nice blend of color.. but it doesn''t appeal to me very much.</td>', 'perhaps the tree''s were moving.. perhaps you liked the sort of abstract look, .. it is a nice blend of color.. but it doesn''t appeal to me very much.', '2004-10-18 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(963803, 113666, 2741, '<td valign="top">Title: 3  -- Spelled Wrong...  VERRAZANO  with 2 "R"s<br/>Exposure: 7 -- Looks like a true representation of lighting conditions<br/>Composition: 4 -- Horizon slanted. And the crop should have been tighter. Too much space.<br/>Focus: 4 -- Seems a little soft.<br/> <br/>Overall score: 4</td>', 'Title: 3  -- Spelled Wrong...  VERRAZANO  with 2 "R"sExposure: 7 -- Looks like a true representation of lighting conditionsComposition: 4 -- Horizon slanted. And the crop should have been tighter. Too much space.Focus: 4 -- Seems a little soft. Overall score: 4', '2004-10-18 12:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(963826, 113429, 26316, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2004-10-18 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(963832, 112718, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting &amp; color.  I would have liked to have seen more of the buildings and less of the walkway in the front personally though :)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting & color.  I would have liked to have seen more of the buildings and less of the walkway in the front personally though :)', '2004-10-18 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(963833, 112196, 9763, '<td valign="top">scary!  Heehee.  Fun shot, I like the emphasis on where the lighing is directed.  The photo is a tad bit grey though.  Nice job overall</td>', 'scary!  Heehee.  Fun shot, I like the emphasis on where the lighing is directed.  The photo is a tad bit grey though.  Nice job overall', '2004-10-18 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(963836, 113532, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  I like the crop at the bottom, but it''d be nice if you had the ability to get more of the top of the photo in view too.  The color is a bit too yellow, although I imagine the street lamps were pretty yellow.  Is this how it looked to your eyes when you looked at the street?  If not this yellow, maybe add a little more blue and cyan... just a tiny bit.  :)  Nice photo!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  I like the crop at the bottom, but it''d be nice if you had the ability to get more of the top of the photo in view too.  The color is a bit too yellow, although I imagine the street lamps were pretty yellow.  Is this how it looked to your eyes when you looked at the street?  If not this yellow, maybe add a little more blue and cyan... just a tiny bit.  :)  Nice photo!', '2004-10-18 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(963838, 113526, 9763, '<td valign="top">I love the soft focus.  I never know when to use my diffuser filter personally, but it looks like you did a nice job with the soft focus here!  I like the colors &amp; composition too.  The top (dark) could be cropped out just a tiny bit though.  The river looks very mucky, not totally inviting, though the photo implies beauty.  It''s a mixed feeling.  Nice job though ;)</td>', 'I love the soft focus.  I never know when to use my diffuser filter personally, but it looks like you did a nice job with the soft focus here!  I like the colors & composition too.  The top (dark) could be cropped out just a tiny bit though.  The river looks very mucky, not totally inviting, though the photo implies beauty.  It''s a mixed feeling.  Nice job though ;)', '2004-10-18 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963839, 113429, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The lighting is a bit bright and the yellow is a bit intense, but i like it overall.  :)</td>', 'Great composition.  The lighting is a bit bright and the yellow is a bit intense, but i like it overall.  :)', '2004-10-18 13:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(963840, 113506, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very unique photos!  How''d you get the sign to light up so evenly without glare?  Great job on that and  the stars!!!</td>', 'Very unique photos!  How''d you get the sign to light up so evenly without glare?  Great job on that and  the stars!!!', '2004-10-18 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(963844, 113687, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  I like the feel too.  I think the photo is still a tad dark, but it''s a great photo, don''t get me wrong.  But perhaps burn the edges a tiny tiny bit prior to future use, maybe :)</td>', 'Great colors!  I like the feel too.  I think the photo is still a tad dark, but it''s a great photo, don''t get me wrong.  But perhaps burn the edges a tiny tiny bit prior to future use, maybe :)', '2004-10-18 13:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(963845, 112695, 9763, '<td valign="top">What did you do to the sky?  That''s insane!  I love the yellow and blue contrast and the location of the kids playing.  Fun photo.  I am not sure what I would change actually.  It''s really high up there on my list.</td>', 'What did you do to the sky?  That''s insane!  I love the yellow and blue contrast and the location of the kids playing.  Fun photo.  I am not sure what I would change actually.  It''s really high up there on my list.', '2004-10-18 13:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(963847, 113220, 9763, '<td valign="top">Excellent post card photo!  The only thing I would recommend is to try to get this shot again without any clouds in the photo (see the right side) and to maybe get more sky so it''s more of a 1/3 shot.  Great job though!!!</td>', 'Excellent post card photo!  The only thing I would recommend is to try to get this shot again without any clouds in the photo (see the right side) and to maybe get more sky so it''s more of a 1/3 shot.  Great job though!!!', '2004-10-18 13:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(963855, 113691, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it''s hard to tell that this photo was taken at NIGHT.  I like the colors a lot.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it''s hard to tell that this photo was taken at NIGHT.  I like the colors a lot.', '2004-10-18 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(963857, 113452, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice color and exposure. I might have cropped just below the reflections for more of a panoramic look.</td>', 'Nice color and exposure. I might have cropped just below the reflections for more of a panoramic look.', '2004-10-18 13:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(963862, 113117, 20754, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure!   I actually would have loved it better if the exposure of the couple crouching in the far corner with the flash-lit ground/wall were the Only exposure leaving the rest in black negative space, for me personally that would have made a stunning &amp; powerful shot in this cropping....but as it is, it is a fine job!</td>', 'Nice long exposure!   I actually would have loved it better if the exposure of the couple crouching in the far corner with the flash-lit ground/wall were the Only exposure leaving the rest in black negative space, for me personally that would have made a stunning & powerful shot in this cropping....but as it is, it is a fine job!', '2004-10-18 14:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(963864, 112544, 20754, '<td valign="top">Wonderful ominous tone to this photo and excellent composition...great job..definitely one of my faves of this challenge!</td>', 'Wonderful ominous tone to this photo and excellent composition...great job..definitely one of my faves of this challenge!', '2004-10-18 14:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963901, 113073, 13136, '<td valign="top">The grain on the sky almost makes it look like a painted backdrop. Works somehow.</td>', 'The grain on the sky almost makes it look like a painted backdrop. Works somehow.', '2004-10-18 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(963904, 113388, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cool scuptures. A bit overexposed maybe. A bit more contrast would help.</td>', 'Cool scuptures. A bit overexposed maybe. A bit more contrast would help.', '2004-10-18 14:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(963908, 113191, 13136, '<td valign="top">The orange sky does not make me think of night, more like it is inside. The light flare of the right adds to that impression.</td>', 'The orange sky does not make me think of night, more like it is inside. The light flare of the right adds to that impression.', '2004-10-18 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(963913, 113517, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, looks like a nuclear plang (I haven''t really seen one with my own two eyes) and the smoke coming from the chimneys give the shot a scary look. Looks like the whole plant is on fire. Foreground and sky is nicely darkened out. Looks like the end of some sci-fi movie. Great job.</td>', 'Great shot, looks like a nuclear plang (I haven''t really seen one with my own two eyes) and the smoke coming from the chimneys give the shot a scary look. Looks like the whole plant is on fire. Foreground and sky is nicely darkened out. Looks like the end of some sci-fi movie. Great job.', '2004-10-18 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(963914, 113643, 7543, '<td valign="top">Seems to be tilting a tad to the right.</td>', 'Seems to be tilting a tad to the right.', '2004-10-18 14:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(963922, 113516, 27524, '<td valign="top">Hmm :) interesting... Hunting at night? The light shining through is real nice.</td>', 'Hmm :) interesting... Hunting at night? The light shining through is real nice.', '2004-10-18 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(963923, 113115, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice done... i like those small lights in buildings... not sure if color of sky is real but looks good.</td>', 'Nice done... i like those small lights in buildings... not sure if color of sky is real but looks good.', '2004-10-18 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(963925, 113674, 18080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture<br/>Well done i love it<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Beautiful captureWell done i love itGood luck', '2004-10-18 15:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(963928, 112357, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot<br/>10<br/>Love it, just makes you want to look at it closer and closer<br/>good luck</td>', 'Nice shot10Love it, just makes you want to look at it closer and closergood luck', '2004-10-18 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(963929, 113634, 7543, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Figure in the tunnel gives it the extra it needs. The nice duotone and the slight tilting (wide angle look) makes it look like something from an Alfred Hitchcock film. Reminds me of my old neighborhood in downtown Reykjavik, is it? Great job!</td>', 'Cool shot. Figure in the tunnel gives it the extra it needs. The nice duotone and the slight tilting (wide angle look) makes it look like something from an Alfred Hitchcock film. Reminds me of my old neighborhood in downtown Reykjavik, is it? Great job!', '2004-10-18 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(963932, 113191, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very different, you must have used hue/saturation to make the sky so wonderfully orange? Good composition, dof and exp. Good job</td>', 'Very different, you must have used hue/saturation to make the sky so wonderfully orange? Good composition, dof and exp. Good job', '2004-10-18 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(963933, 113682, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its good shot...and quality is good. I like light turning in dark... but im afraid object is not so interesting... and not enough artistic too. I wish im wrong.</td>', 'Its good shot...and quality is good. I like light turning in dark... but im afraid object is not so interesting... and not enough artistic too. I wish im wrong.', '2004-10-18 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(963935, 112790, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice balance in a very low key shot! Gradiance on the horizon looks perfect, a truly optimal expose (lights not blown out, details showing). I bet there are a bunch of people willing to pay for this (would look great on your wall or could sell as an stock photo). Different from your typical DPC shot, I love it.</td>', 'Very nice balance in a very low key shot! Gradiance on the horizon looks perfect, a truly optimal expose (lights not blown out, details showing). I bet there are a bunch of people willing to pay for this (would look great on your wall or could sell as an stock photo). Different from your typical DPC shot, I love it.', '2004-10-18 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(963938, 113475, 7543, '<td valign="top">Tad overexposed for my taste. Good colors.</td>', 'Tad overexposed for my taste. Good colors.', '2004-10-18 15:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(963941, 112940, 7543, '<td valign="top">Must have been a very loooong exp. Love the moving stars effect.</td>', 'Must have been a very loooong exp. Love the moving stars effect.', '2004-10-18 15:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(963945, 113429, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, a tad overexposed (lights blend).</td>', 'Nice reflection, a tad overexposed (lights blend).', '2004-10-18 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(963946, 113359, 7543, '<td valign="top">Who the hell has cristmas lights on now! lol</td>', 'Who the hell has cristmas lights on now! lol', '2004-10-18 15:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(963948, 113440, 7543, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit over-sharpened (evident on the towers on the left. Great colors (red looks super in the bottom left corner.)</td>', 'A tiny bit over-sharpened (evident on the towers on the left. Great colors (red looks super in the bottom left corner.)', '2004-10-18 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(963949, 113196, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yeah, first think you see is that big star in dark sky... and then cames small church. At least it looks small :). Its interesting shot but it misses spot where your eye can stay on. But im really curious of bell... to see it bigger.</td>', 'Yeah, first think you see is that big star in dark sky... and then cames small church. At least it looks small :). Its interesting shot but it misses spot where your eye can stay on. But im really curious of bell... to see it bigger.', '2004-10-18 15:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(963950, 113582, 16493, '<td valign="top">don''t like this frame, nice fireworks.</td>', 'don''t like this frame, nice fireworks.', '2004-10-18 15:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(963951, 112168, 18080, '<td valign="top">This shot looks really out of focus. Could be deliberate. But it distracts in my opinion<br/></td>', 'This shot looks really out of focus. Could be deliberate. But it distracts in my opinion', '2004-10-18 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(963952, 113167, 7543, '<td valign="top">What a great subject for a photo! Very nicely carried out too (I''m guessing this one will end up high).</td>', 'What a great subject for a photo! Very nicely carried out too (I''m guessing this one will end up high).', '2004-10-18 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(963954, 113506, 7543, '<td valign="top">Fín hugmynd. Einum of "hreint" skilti kannski, lítur út fyrir að skiltinu hafi verið bætt inn í með myndvinnslu sem gerir þetta pínu óraunverulegt. Flott að ná stjörnunum fínum og skiltið í forgrunni.</td>', 'Fín hugmynd. Einum of "hreint" skilti kannski, lítur út fyrir að skiltinu hafi verið bætt inn í með myndvinnslu sem gerir þetta pínu óraunverulegt. Flott að ná stjörnunum fínum og skiltið í forgrunni.', '2004-10-18 15:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(963955, 113688, 7543, '<td valign="top">Síminn?</td>', 'Síminn?', '2004-10-18 15:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963958, 113604, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Seems to be tilting to the right a bit though. Good colors and texture.</td>', 'Good subject. Seems to be tilting to the right a bit though. Good colors and texture.', '2004-10-18 15:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(963959, 112901, 7543, '<td valign="top">What seems to be .jpg distortion in the sky is distracting.</td>', 'What seems to be .jpg distortion in the sky is distracting.', '2004-10-18 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(963960, 113433, 16493, '<td valign="top">don''t like the frame , good picture.</td>', 'don''t like the frame , good picture.', '2004-10-18 15:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(963963, 113532, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its good quality... but moust of picture its just cars and garbage boxes. Ok maybe it was intentional night life :).</td>', 'Its good quality... but moust of picture its just cars and garbage boxes. Ok maybe it was intentional night life :).', '2004-10-18 15:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(963969, 112695, 15574, '<td valign="top">The sky is amazing</td>', 'The sky is amazing', '2004-10-18 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(963972, 113466, 20774, '<td valign="top">nice picture but i guess the colors are too strong, i don''t know if you really ment to do that!</td>', 'nice picture but i guess the colors are too strong, i don''t know if you really ment to do that!', '2004-10-18 15:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(964000, 113532, 18197, '<td valign="top">I spotted this photo right away when I began voting. In my view, it is exceptional. It''s not exactly your happy happy shot that might do well here. But it has a very strong composition. I like the busy top half juxtaposed with the empty bottom half ... sort of a life and death image. The color works very well. It feels late and lonely on the street ... like I''d want to be indoors where it is warm and bright. The focus and deep DOF is terrific. In the end ... all the technicalities are virtually perfect. But it''s better than that ... it conveys deep emotional impact. My top pick!</td>', 'I spotted this photo right away when I began voting. In my view, it is exceptional. It''s not exactly your happy happy shot that might do well here. But it has a very strong composition. I like the busy top half juxtaposed with the empty bottom half ... sort of a life and death image. The color works very well. It feels late and lonely on the street ... like I''d want to be indoors where it is warm and bright. The focus and deep DOF is terrific. In the end ... all the technicalities are virtually perfect. But it''s better than that ... it conveys deep emotional impact. My top pick!', '2004-10-18 16:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(964001, 112937, 19445, '<td valign="top">Almost too many geometric patterns</td>', 'Almost too many geometric patterns', '2004-10-18 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(964005, 113348, 20774, '<td valign="top">WOW this is really neat! its really a great shot! love the colors! love the way you bput the car so focused and everything else in motion! and i wonder how you did this! Keep it on!</td>', 'WOW this is really neat! its really a great shot! love the colors! love the way you bput the car so focused and everything else in motion! and i wonder how you did this! Keep it on!', '2004-10-18 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(964006, 113438, 19445, '<td valign="top">My eye keeps looking for a main focal point</td>', 'My eye keeps looking for a main focal point', '2004-10-18 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(964009, 112795, 19445, '<td valign="top">I like the line of ore cars - the machinery overly complicates the shot, tho</td>', 'I like the line of ore cars - the machinery overly complicates the shot, tho', '2004-10-18 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(964011, 113259, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can''t articulate all the reasons I like this so much, but I do. Partly it makes very good use of white points and black points. The focus and deep DOF are  technically excellent. Composition with the reflections and the subject ships is strong. Among my top picls. Hope it ribbons !</td>', 'I can''t articulate all the reasons I like this so much, but I do. Partly it makes very good use of white points and black points. The focus and deep DOF are  technically excellent. Composition with the reflections and the subject ships is strong. Among my top picls. Hope it ribbons !', '2004-10-18 16:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(964012, 113681, 19445, '<td valign="top">seems like a little too much light spillage</td>', 'seems like a little too much light spillage', '2004-10-18 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(964013, 113682, 19445, '<td valign="top">nice - maybe a tighter crop would have worked better</td>', 'nice - maybe a tighter crop would have worked better', '2004-10-18 16:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(964018, 113647, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the "stairway to nowhere" notion of this. Grays are effective at conveying an edgy emotional reaction to night. Leading lines and composition generally work well. In the end, it''s simply one of the more pleasing images I''ve seen. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I like the "stairway to nowhere" notion of this. Grays are effective at conveying an edgy emotional reaction to night. Leading lines and composition generally work well. In the end, it''s simply one of the more pleasing images I''ve seen. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-18 16:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(964019, 113452, 19445, '<td valign="top">The inky black of the shoreline seems to detract from the image</td>', 'The inky black of the shoreline seems to detract from the image', '2004-10-18 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(964020, 112795, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. (You may be wishing you''d saved this for Implied Lines, but I digress). I like the way the rail cars lead my eye across the image and then back. I like that the lights in the background reinforce this. Not really any nits to pick. Among my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'Fantastic photo. (You may be wishing you''d saved this for Implied Lines, but I digress). I like the way the rail cars lead my eye across the image and then back. I like that the lights in the background reinforce this. Not really any nits to pick. Among my top picks this challenge.', '2004-10-18 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(964021, 113517, 19445, '<td valign="top">Love the impression of movement from the steam</td>', 'Love the impression of movement from the steam', '2004-10-18 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(964022, 112695, 19445, '<td valign="top">the pattern in the pavement could have added to the shot if taken from a lower position</td>', 'the pattern in the pavement could have added to the shot if taken from a lower position', '2004-10-18 16:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(964024, 113587, 19445, '<td valign="top">The poles seem to interfere rather than enhance - perhaps if they had framed the bottom of the Abbey</td>', 'The poles seem to interfere rather than enhance - perhaps if they had framed the bottom of the Abbey', '2004-10-18 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(964025, 112927, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Razor sharp ... which is not so easy at night. Levels, white points and black points are very very good. Good subject for the challenge and well composed. I was going to nit pick a bit about the pickup truck in front of the church. But the more I think about it, I think it''s okay. It provides scale  and it provides an intellectual point of contrast that compliments the contrast of the rest of the photo. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Beautiful! Razor sharp ... which is not so easy at night. Levels, white points and black points are very very good. Good subject for the challenge and well composed. I was going to nit pick a bit about the pickup truck in front of the church. But the more I think about it, I think it''s okay. It provides scale  and it provides an intellectual point of contrast that compliments the contrast of the rest of the photo. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-18 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(964026, 112793, 19445, '<td valign="top">Right on the edge of too confusing - nice framing with the foliage</td>', 'Right on the edge of too confusing - nice framing with the foliage', '2004-10-18 16:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(964027, 113167, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen other photos of this (not in this challenge) at various times of day and weather combinations. Shooting it at night and catching the reflections was a great idea and it''s well executed. Among my top picks.</td>', 'I''ve seen other photos of this (not in this challenge) at various times of day and weather combinations. Shooting it at night and catching the reflections was a great idea and it''s well executed. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-18 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(964028, 113467, 19445, '<td valign="top">Good use of the masts with the smokestack - a little busy</td>', 'Good use of the masts with the smokestack - a little busy', '2004-10-18 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(964031, 113559, 19445, '<td valign="top">a little too much tree in this - a tighter crop might have worked better</td>', 'a little too much tree in this - a tighter crop might have worked better', '2004-10-18 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(964035, 113475, 3569, '<td valign="top">Over exposure works well on this shot.</td>', 'Over exposure works well on this shot.', '2004-10-18 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(964037, 113327, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, focus, colors. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Great contrast, focus, colors. Among my top picks.', '2004-10-18 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
