(964074, 112940, 24962, '<td valign="top">I really find myself coming back to view your photo. What else could I give it, but a 10. Well Done and Good Luck!</td>', 'I really find myself coming back to view your photo. What else could I give it, but a 10. Well Done and Good Luck!', '2004-10-18 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(964075, 113507, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''m fond of this kind of effect at all.  I have to admit that it looks more like someone rammed into the camera during a long exposure than a serious attempt at art.  Sorry to be blunt... :(</td>', 'I can''t say I''m fond of this kind of effect at all.  I have to admit that it looks more like someone rammed into the camera during a long exposure than a serious attempt at art.  Sorry to be blunt... :(', '2004-10-18 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(964076, 113504, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good angle, getting the plants in the picture.</td>', 'Good angle, getting the plants in the picture.', '2004-10-18 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(964077, 113590, 18197, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t resonate with me. Technically it''s a good workmanlike image except possibly for comp. I think it''s that the subject matter leaves me a little cold. Sorry to seem negative. Just my opinion.</td>', 'This doesn''t resonate with me. Technically it''s a good workmanlike image except possibly for comp. I think it''s that the subject matter leaves me a little cold. Sorry to seem negative. Just my opinion.', '2004-10-18 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(964078, 112992, 3102, '<td valign="top">It fits the challenge, but it''s extremely difficult to tell what I''m looking at beyond what the title suggests.  There''s no good point of reference or focal point here, I''m afraid.</td>', 'It fits the challenge, but it''s extremely difficult to tell what I''m looking at beyond what the title suggests.  There''s no good point of reference or focal point here, I''m afraid.', '2004-10-18 16:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(964080, 112292, 24962, '<td valign="top">I think I recall an earlier shot of the same subject, but viewed from another angle. Could be wrong, but don''t really care. It is an awesome shot that fully deserves its 10. Good Luck!</td>', 'I think I recall an earlier shot of the same subject, but viewed from another angle. Could be wrong, but don''t really care. It is an awesome shot that fully deserves its 10. Good Luck!', '2004-10-18 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(964081, 113563, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I''m just not into the whole abstract scene.  I''m sure that some folks will like the abstract nature of it, but I have to be honest in saying that it just doesn''t grab me... :(</td>', 'I''m afraid I''m just not into the whole abstract scene.  I''m sure that some folks will like the abstract nature of it, but I have to be honest in saying that it just doesn''t grab me... :(', '2004-10-18 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(964083, 113388, 18197, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Goofy subject. Might have been better with different lighting. Good luck.</td>', 'This made me smile. Goofy subject. Might have been better with different lighting. Good luck.', '2004-10-18 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(964086, 113398, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, it meets the challenge, but I have to admit there''s not a whole lot of anything interesting going on here.  In all honesty, my reaction was "so what?"  I don''t mean to be harsh, but it doesn''t really evoke any kind of emotion and it leaves me wondering why someone would choose this as a challenge topic... :(</td>', 'Well, it meets the challenge, but I have to admit there''s not a whole lot of anything interesting going on here.  In all honesty, my reaction was "so what?"  I don''t mean to be harsh, but it doesn''t really evoke any kind of emotion and it leaves me wondering why someone would choose this as a challenge topic... :(', '2004-10-18 16:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(964087, 113581, 13136, '<td valign="top">A little bit of camera shake it looks like.</td>', 'A little bit of camera shake it looks like.', '2004-10-18 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(964088, 113680, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what the point may have been here.  It seems like this is a fairly random shot that was desaturated for some reason... sorry...</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what the point may have been here.  It seems like this is a fairly random shot that was desaturated for some reason... sorry...', '2004-10-18 16:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
