(964359, 113485, 28070, '<td valign="top">well I know you took the photo at night but it really doesn''t show that much darkness with the flash on everything.</td>', 'well I know you took the photo at night but it really doesn''t show that much darkness with the flash on everything.', '2004-10-18 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(964361, 113168, 2553, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to make out exactly what I am looking at here.  I think I see a "person", and I am guessing that the lights are from a town, not water, but the flash on the near rocks is rather unsightly, and is certainly a distraction.  I can''t figure out what the red thing is either - a pole maybe, since that other thing looks like a chain, but gosh, I hate to have to work this hard just to figure out what''s IN the photo, let alone comment on what I''m supposed to see, when I can''t really see very much.</td>', 'It''s hard to make out exactly what I am looking at here.  I think I see a "person", and I am guessing that the lights are from a town, not water, but the flash on the near rocks is rather unsightly, and is certainly a distraction.  I can''t figure out what the red thing is either - a pole maybe, since that other thing looks like a chain, but gosh, I hate to have to work this hard just to figure out what''s IN the photo, let alone comment on what I''m supposed to see, when I can''t really see very much.', '2004-10-18 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(964363, 112292, 13602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image verry dramatic.</td>', 'Beautiful image verry dramatic.', '2004-10-18 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(964366, 113024, 13602, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful, verry nice retro feeling in this. 10</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful, verry nice retro feeling in this. 10', '2004-10-18 20:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(964370, 113680, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry, I almost never say this, but there is nothing in this photo that I find appealing at all.  I''m not sure if this is a case of selective desat, (which I am not opposed to), or just weird colors, but I just don''t like it.  I can''t even determine what the actual subject is, or what those green things are.  The only suggestion I could possibly make to improve this photo is to suggest that you take a different one.  Sorry.</td>', 'I''m so sorry, I almost never say this, but there is nothing in this photo that I find appealing at all.  I''m not sure if this is a case of selective desat, (which I am not opposed to), or just weird colors, but I just don''t like it.  I can''t even determine what the actual subject is, or what those green things are.  The only suggestion I could possibly make to improve this photo is to suggest that you take a different one.  Sorry.', '2004-10-18 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(964372, 113440, 13602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, as a personal choice I would of probably cropped out  from the bottom of it, because that part is not so inbteresting and it distracts the eye. But that''s just my choice your image is wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful image, as a personal choice I would of probably cropped out  from the bottom of it, because that part is not so inbteresting and it distracts the eye. But that''s just my choice your image is wonderful.', '2004-10-18 20:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(964376, 113640, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good food, home of the square burger patty.</td>', 'Good food, home of the square burger patty.', '2004-10-18 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(964383, 113263, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good imagination and title. The blur is very good.  Some more exiting background would have helped. -7</td>', 'Good imagination and title. The blur is very good.  Some more exiting background would have helped. -7', '2004-10-18 20:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(964384, 113581, 28070, '<td valign="top">A little blurry</td>', 'A little blurry', '2004-10-18 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(964389, 112718, 12160, '<td valign="top">Something in this shot is very appealing and has a nostalgic feel to it. I think it''s either a back entrance or was taken very late at night (although the sky wouldn''t make someone thinks so) since there are very few people in the scene... unusual for a New York City subway station. I like the motion blur of the long shutter, the light inside the station is well controlled to illuminate it. The yellow tint of the street lamp adds mood to the photo although I would have preferred the whole picture a little darker. The dark buildings in the background with the lit windows are wonderful addition. A few technical flaws: perspective correction of the buildings to straighten them up, some obvious halos around the darker buildings and color noise in the sky. These are minor and can easily be addressed by image editor. Overall, I like it. Marked as favorite. 8</td>', 'Something in this shot is very appealing and has a nostalgic feel to it. I think it''s either a back entrance or was taken very late at night (although the sky wouldn''t make someone thinks so) since there are very few people in the scene... unusual for a New York City subway station. I like the motion blur of the long shutter, the light inside the station is well controlled to illuminate it. The yellow tint of the street lamp adds mood to the photo although I would have preferred the whole picture a little darker. The dark buildings in the background with the lit windows are wonderful addition. A few technical flaws: perspective correction of the buildings to straighten them up, some obvious halos around the darker buildings and color noise in the sky. These are minor and can easily be addressed by image editor. Overall, I like it. Marked as favorite. 8', '2004-10-18 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(964390, 113517, 24642, '<td valign="top">Strange stuff, but I like it.  Perhaps some post processing on the brightest lights would have helped.  I also think that a lower viewpoint might work better.  -7</td>', 'Strange stuff, but I like it.  Perhaps some post processing on the brightest lights would have helped.  I also think that a lower viewpoint might work better.  -7', '2004-10-18 20:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(964391, 113339, 28070, '<td valign="top">without that moon up their it''s a Nice shot.  With the moon however it''s a great shot.</td>', 'without that moon up their it''s a Nice shot.  With the moon however it''s a great shot.', '2004-10-18 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(964392, 113634, 21617, '<td valign="top">spooky stuff</td>', 'spooky stuff', '2004-10-18 20:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
