(964397, 113504, 24642, '<td valign="top">Exiting colours and composition.  It seems to me that there is a lighthouse behind the two buildings but I''m not sure.  I find the big light a bit too bright and it draws the attention from an otherwise very good photograph.  -7</td>', 'Exiting colours and composition.  It seems to me that there is a lighthouse behind the two buildings but I''m not sure.  I find the big light a bit too bright and it draws the attention from an otherwise very good photograph.  -7', '2004-10-18 20:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
