(964511, 113673, 4877, '<td valign="top">I love your shot concept here.  Very clever idea.  The colour tones are a bit muted and the shot is a little blurry for my liking.  But you''ve done well.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I love your shot concept here.  Very clever idea.  The colour tones are a bit muted and the shot is a little blurry for my liking.  But you''ve done well.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-10-18 22:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(964517, 113679, 4877, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette effect.  Unfortunately there seems to be no main subject to your photo - no point of interest.  The grass in the foreground is interesting, but not interesting enough to hold my attention for very long.  Keep practising.  You''ve made a good start here.</td>', 'Good silhouette effect.  Unfortunately there seems to be no main subject to your photo - no point of interest.  The grass in the foreground is interesting, but not interesting enough to hold my attention for very long.  Keep practising.  You''ve made a good start here.', '2004-10-18 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(964524, 112992, 4877, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot in that you have managed to capture the "cottage" without over-exposing the highlights too much.  There is a wide range of contrast to this shot.  I cant really make out the "cottage" you refer to in your image title though.  I can only really make out a fence and a few trees, and something lit up in the background.  For me to have voted this higher, I would have liked a clearer view of what your main subject was.  Keep at it.  Every shot makes you a better photographer if you learn from it!</td>', 'This is a good shot in that you have managed to capture the "cottage" without over-exposing the highlights too much.  There is a wide range of contrast to this shot.  I cant really make out the "cottage" you refer to in your image title though.  I can only really make out a fence and a few trees, and something lit up in the background.  For me to have voted this higher, I would have liked a clearer view of what your main subject was.  Keep at it.  Every shot makes you a better photographer if you learn from it!', '2004-10-18 22:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(964530, 113581, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of this shot.</td>', 'I like the starkness of this shot.', '2004-10-18 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(964533, 113518, 7504, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, the light on the cobblestones is lovely.  The figure could be a little more focused.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, the light on the cobblestones is lovely.  The figure could be a little more focused.', '2004-10-18 22:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(964537, 113673, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, a transition between sunset and night.  I little fuzzy, but I like it!</td>', 'This is lovely, a transition between sunset and night.  I little fuzzy, but I like it!', '2004-10-18 22:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(964538, 113681, 4877, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo of the tree.  It is well captured, and you''ve obviously used a long exposure to capture the breeze in the branches.  You''re well on the way to getting plenty of good night shots!  A suggestion would be to play with white balance if you have that option on your camera.  The tree is lit with a yellowish hue, and perhaps you could get some great effects by changing the white balance or boosting some of the hue''s in photoshop afterwards.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'This is a good photo of the tree.  It is well captured, and you''ve obviously used a long exposure to capture the breeze in the branches.  You''re well on the way to getting plenty of good night shots!  A suggestion would be to play with white balance if you have that option on your camera.  The tree is lit with a yellowish hue, and perhaps you could get some great effects by changing the white balance or boosting some of the hue''s in photoshop afterwards.  Keep up the good work!', '2004-10-18 22:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(964541, 113220, 4877, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  I''m guessing a DSLR of some description!<br/> <br/>Brilliant clarity, exposure is perfect.  Love your composition.<br/> <br/>One of my favourites for the challenge!  Good luck!  10</td>', 'I love this shot!  I''m guessing a DSLR of some description! Brilliant clarity, exposure is perfect.  Love your composition. One of my favourites for the challenge!  Good luck!  10', '2004-10-18 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
