(964630, 113604, 20754, '<td valign="top">one of the first shots of the challenge i have given a high score to...it would''ve been even higher if it wasn''t for the highlights on the sidewalk...love the centered composition but would have preferred the sidewalk cropped out...keep in mind that the eye tends to drift toward the brighter highlighted areas of a shot...the white highlights on the sidewalk takes away from the bold yet darker majesty of the central sculpture weakening the overall shot...if i look at the shot with the sidwalk cropped out it definitely enhances the shot, making the sculpture stand out more despite the highlights on the tree edges which actually frame the sculpture nicely...great job!</td>', 'one of the first shots of the challenge i have given a high score to...it would''ve been even higher if it wasn''t for the highlights on the sidewalk...love the centered composition but would have preferred the sidewalk cropped out...keep in mind that the eye tends to drift toward the brighter highlighted areas of a shot...the white highlights on the sidewalk takes away from the bold yet darker majesty of the central sculpture weakening the overall shot...if i look at the shot with the sidwalk cropped out it definitely enhances the shot, making the sculpture stand out more despite the highlights on the tree edges which actually frame the sculpture nicely...great job!', '2004-10-18 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
