(965220, 113367, 16004, '<td valign="top">very pretty skies.  the rich oranges are oil-painting like in their appearance.  visually this is striking, no doubt, though the land mass is a bit plain, really.  i have no idea if dusk can be construed to be night, so i''m going to let that one go.  6.</td>', 'very pretty skies.  the rich oranges are oil-painting like in their appearance.  visually this is striking, no doubt, though the land mass is a bit plain, really.  i have no idea if dusk can be construed to be night, so i''m going to let that one go.  6.', '2004-10-19 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
