(965225, 112717, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is one of my absolute favourites of the challenge.  i totally adore the brightness and boldness of the colours.  the light and shadows are very effective, and the person certainly adds to the grimness of the shot.  composition is excellent (very rule of thirds)...  i wonder how much of the colour is original?  very cool location, any way.  10.</td>', 'this is one of my absolute favourites of the challenge.  i totally adore the brightness and boldness of the colours.  the light and shadows are very effective, and the person certainly adds to the grimness of the shot.  composition is excellent (very rule of thirds)...  i wonder how much of the colour is original?  very cool location, any way.  10.', '2004-10-19 12:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(965238, 113624, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love the moodiness of this...  it would appear from the motion of her right hand that this was taken whilst actually playing - i think just posing would have provided a sharper image here.  i like the lighting, the background, cool violin and, erm, nice attire :)   this is a pretty rich photograph.  9.</td>', 'i love the moodiness of this...  it would appear from the motion of her right hand that this was taken whilst actually playing - i think just posing would have provided a sharper image here.  i like the lighting, the background, cool violin and, erm, nice attire :)   this is a pretty rich photograph.  9.', '2004-10-19 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
