(965384, 113649, 19936, '<td valign="top">Side lighting on this shot was a good idea.  I think the subject lacked definition though.  Maybe a lower angle and use the fence more as it adds interesting lines for me.  Keep up the work and good luck.</td>', 'Side lighting on this shot was a good idea.  I think the subject lacked definition though.  Maybe a lower angle and use the fence more as it adds interesting lines for me.  Keep up the work and good luck.', '2004-10-19 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
