(965531, 113504, 18485, '<td valign="top">great shot.  nice focal point and amazing sky.  excellent work</td>', 'great shot.  nice focal point and amazing sky.  excellent work', '2004-10-19 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(965534, 113674, 18485, '<td valign="top">my favorite of the moody squalid night shots.  well seen and executed.</td>', 'my favorite of the moody squalid night shots.  well seen and executed.', '2004-10-19 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(965539, 113167, 26061, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait for the print of this one... my favorite!</td>', 'Can''t wait for the print of this one... my favorite!', '2004-10-19 18:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(965576, 113581, 9763, '<td valign="top">It is a bit blurry i am afraid.  I would also like to see the clouds on the right disappear.  THe lighitng is nice for the most part, but a little bright in the direct center, mid way up.  good luck</td>', 'It is a bit blurry i am afraid.  I would also like to see the clouds on the right disappear.  THe lighitng is nice for the most part, but a little bright in the direct center, mid way up.  good luck', '2004-10-19 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(965578, 113171, 9763, '<td valign="top">i like the colors, but i am not too keen on the composition.  I think I would like ot see the tops of the boats more than the mucky water.  The lighting is very nice.</td>', 'i like the colors, but i am not too keen on the composition.  I think I would like ot see the tops of the boats more than the mucky water.  The lighting is very nice.', '2004-10-19 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(965580, 113339, 9763, '<td valign="top">nice colors, great capture of the moon.  The photo is not all that engaging for me unless i worked on the docks at a factory near a pretty bridge like that, but the composition is nice.</td>', 'nice colors, great capture of the moon.  The photo is not all that engaging for me unless i worked on the docks at a factory near a pretty bridge like that, but the composition is nice.', '2004-10-19 18:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(965581, 112607, 9763, '<td valign="top">The tree really doesn''t ''add'' to the photo in my opinion.  the sky is beautiful, and perhaps a silhouette of a street lamp, or something more defined and unique to your area.  the tree could be a little darker though, it''s still got a feeling of ''color'' to it when it should be stark black against a sky like this :)  Good luck</td>', 'The tree really doesn''t ''add'' to the photo in my opinion.  the sky is beautiful, and perhaps a silhouette of a street lamp, or something more defined and unique to your area.  the tree could be a little darker though, it''s still got a feeling of ''color'' to it when it should be stark black against a sky like this :)  Good luck', '2004-10-19 18:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(965584, 113659, 9763, '<td valign="top">What a bright store!  I think the color is okay here.  The composition is not really to my liking.  I''d prefer to see the store lower in the frame, not cropped so tightly on the left, and rotated a tiny bit counter clockwise.  Also, the lighting is very bright inside, but not bright enough outside for this photo to grab me.  I think a slower ISO and a higher fstop (maybe f11) would work better.  Stars would be nice too!  Good luck</td>', 'What a bright store!  I think the color is okay here.  The composition is not really to my liking.  I''d prefer to see the store lower in the frame, not cropped so tightly on the left, and rotated a tiny bit counter clockwise.  Also, the lighting is very bright inside, but not bright enough outside for this photo to grab me.  I think a slower ISO and a higher fstop (maybe f11) would work better.  Stars would be nice too!  Good luck', '2004-10-19 18:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(965682, 112657, 24642, '<td valign="top">Creative thinking and what a great tone. I like the balance of the shot.  The title is good and makes sense with the blurry people walking by.</td>', 'Creative thinking and what a great tone. I like the balance of the shot.  The title is good and makes sense with the blurry people walking by.', '2004-10-19 20:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(965702, 113315, 25788, '<td valign="top">Very surreal...I like it.</td>', 'Very surreal...I like it.', '2004-10-19 20:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(965763, 113497, 3724, '<td valign="top">I would say Romanesque.  Pretty blue window.</td>', 'I would say Romanesque.  Pretty blue window.', '2004-10-19 22:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(965819, 113348, 20941, '<td valign="top">MY pick for Blue! Excellent Image, best of luck!</td>', 'MY pick for Blue! Excellent Image, best of luck!', '2004-10-19 22:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(965846, 112275, 10080, '<td valign="top">SO many great shots on this, and your was one of them! Love the colors and overall feeling.</td>', 'SO many great shots on this, and your was one of them! Love the colors and overall feeling.', '2004-10-19 23:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(965847, 113363, 10080, '<td valign="top">I think this is a awesome shot! Great overall feeling!</td>', 'I think this is a awesome shot! Great overall feeling!', '2004-10-19 23:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(965885, 113429, 20420, '<td valign="top">This picture is awsome.      great job!</td>', 'This picture is awsome.      great job!', '2004-10-19 23:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(965929, 113327, 28070, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. it''s crisp. the white really stands out on these buildings.</td>', 'I like this shot. it''s crisp. the white really stands out on these buildings.', '2004-10-20 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(965936, 113398, 28070, '<td valign="top">Well there is a bunch of lens glare and whose car is that next to the beetle, maybe lose that car or get a another beetle.</td>', 'Well there is a bunch of lens glare and whose car is that next to the beetle, maybe lose that car or get a another beetle.', '2004-10-20 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(965937, 113519, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach but the play of light and shadow on the  model''s face gives her an oddly jowely, canine appearance.</td>', 'Interesting approach but the play of light and shadow on the  model''s face gives her an oddly jowely, canine appearance.', '2004-10-20 00:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(965939, 113196, 28070, '<td valign="top">I like the light against the back of the building, you can really make out the outline.</td>', 'I like the light against the back of the building, you can really make out the outline.', '2004-10-20 00:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(965941, 112648, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. Just my opinion, but this is a rather mundane interpretation--kind of like an inexpensive postcard. The horizon is a bit tilted.</td>', 'Good exposure. Just my opinion, but this is a rather mundane interpretation--kind of like an inexpensive postcard. The horizon is a bit tilted.', '2004-10-20 00:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(965944, 113687, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot. I like the converging parallel lines the path creates.</td>', 'Nice moody shot. I like the converging parallel lines the path creates.', '2004-10-20 00:18:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(965946, 112927, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice Black and white. I like it.</td>', 'Nice Black and white. I like it.', '2004-10-20 00:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(965953, 112992, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit blurry---like it was taken without the benefit of a tripod. I don''t see a lot to focus on. That dark blobby shape takes up an awful lot of the picture plane without any payoff in terms of interest. I don''t really see a focal point here. Whatever it was about this scene that spoke to you hasn''t really been communicated to me in this shot.</td>', 'This looks a bit blurry---like it was taken without the benefit of a tripod. I don''t see a lot to focus on. That dark blobby shape takes up an awful lot of the picture plane without any payoff in terms of interest. I don''t really see a focal point here. Whatever it was about this scene that spoke to you hasn''t really been communicated to me in this shot.', '2004-10-20 00:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(965954, 112773, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and nice composition. It doesn''t really hold my interest however.</td>', 'Good exposure and nice composition. It doesn''t really hold my interest however.', '2004-10-20 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(965955, 113506, 28070, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  Maybe a little more star power. The sign is too bright. Really it fades out the rest of the thing.</td>', 'Cool idea.  Maybe a little more star power. The sign is too bright. Really it fades out the rest of the thing.', '2004-10-20 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(965956, 112790, 28070, '<td valign="top">I like it. Big Dipper right in the center.</td>', 'I like it. Big Dipper right in the center.', '2004-10-20 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(965957, 112790, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the expanse of huge starry sky. There is a nice tension between the sky and the landscape at the bottom half of the frame. This almost looks like a book illustration rather than a photograph. Very nice.</td>', 'I like the expanse of huge starry sky. There is a nice tension between the sky and the landscape at the bottom half of the frame. This almost looks like a book illustration rather than a photograph. Very nice.', '2004-10-20 00:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(965960, 113647, 28070, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Leads you right into the theme.</td>', 'Great picture.  Leads you right into the theme.', '2004-10-20 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(965961, 113336, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the odd, gingerbread looking house. I see that it is really just an ordinary Cape decorated for Halloween but the awnings and the dripping stuff nake it look like something out of a wierd storybook. It isn''t really a great photo but I like the feel of it anyway.</td>', 'I like the odd, gingerbread looking house. I see that it is really just an ordinary Cape decorated for Halloween but the awnings and the dripping stuff nake it look like something out of a wierd storybook. It isn''t really a great photo but I like the feel of it anyway.', '2004-10-20 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(965963, 113649, 28070, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see anything.  You captured the night part alright.</td>', 'I can''t really see anything.  You captured the night part alright.', '2004-10-20 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(965966, 113532, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of the dark alley and the yellowish light. Beyond that, there really isn''t enough to grab my attention for long. The cars add too much of a mundane element, detracting from the spooky quality, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the mood of the dark alley and the yellowish light. Beyond that, there really isn''t enough to grab my attention for long. The cars add too much of a mundane element, detracting from the spooky quality, in my opinion.', '2004-10-20 00:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(965967, 113117, 28070, '<td valign="top">Looks like you did this with a strobe light on a timer.  That is an awsome creative idea.  I like it. Excellent work.</td>', 'Looks like you did this with a strobe light on a timer.  That is an awsome creative idea.  I like it. Excellent work.', '2004-10-20 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(965992, 113167, 21554, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote, but wanted to say WOW!</td>', 'Can''t vote, but wanted to say WOW!', '2004-10-20 01:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(965997, 113655, 7322, '<td valign="top">You got a nice exposure but the subject is just too boring for me.</td>', 'You got a nice exposure but the subject is just too boring for me.', '2004-10-20 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(965998, 112657, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice mood. Interesting location.I like the blurry figures passing in front of the main subject. Good job!</td>', 'Nice mood. Interesting location.I like the blurry figures passing in front of the main subject. Good job!', '2004-10-20 01:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(966006, 113599, 7322, '<td valign="top">|sn''t anything of interest for me in this shot. It''s a bit busy and seems to lack a focal point. The tower with the glowing lights, and the flag in the background detract from the statement you may have been attempting to make with the arrows (a subject which has potential in my opinion).</td>', '|sn''t anything of interest for me in this shot. It''s a bit busy and seems to lack a focal point. The tower with the glowing lights, and the flag in the background detract from the statement you may have been attempting to make with the arrows (a subject which has potential in my opinion).', '2004-10-20 01:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(966012, 113680, 7322, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t an interesting subject or composition, in my opinion. I''m unsure what the intended focal point was meant to be. If there was something about this scene that captivated your imagination, it hasn''t been clearly communicated to me by this photo.</td>', 'This just isn''t an interesting subject or composition, in my opinion. I''m unsure what the intended focal point was meant to be. If there was something about this scene that captivated your imagination, it hasn''t been clearly communicated to me by this photo.', '2004-10-20 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(966019, 113315, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the unique take on this challenge. The colors are great. This would make a fun Halloween postcard. Good job!</td>', 'I like the unique take on this challenge. The colors are great. This would make a fun Halloween postcard. Good job!', '2004-10-20 01:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(966023, 113366, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very unique take on this challenge. The yellow, blue and purple make for a vibrant and dynamic.The framing of the backhoe is really dramatic. It has the feel of a psychedelic album cover.</td>', 'Very unique take on this challenge. The yellow, blue and purple make for a vibrant and dynamic.The framing of the backhoe is really dramatic. It has the feel of a psychedelic album cover.', '2004-10-20 01:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(966026, 113607, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice take on what could have been a very mundane scene. I like the contrast of the white chairs and the darkness in the background. Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice take on what could have been a very mundane scene. I like the contrast of the white chairs and the darkness in the background. Good lighting.', '2004-10-20 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(966168, 112927, 25189, '<td valign="top">hey, I know that place...  :)</td>', 'hey, I know that place...  :)', '2004-10-20 02:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(966171, 113652, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. Love the glow on the lighthouse.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. Love the glow on the lighthouse.', '2004-10-20 02:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(966174, 113018, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the high contrast in this one. Very dramatic.</td>', 'Wow! Love the high contrast in this one. Very dramatic.', '2004-10-20 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(966178, 113073, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity in this image and the colors.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity in this image and the colors.', '2004-10-20 02:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(966181, 113518, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. Having a person in the picture adds a great deal. Gives it a human touch and scale.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. Having a person in the picture adds a great deal. Gives it a human touch and scale.', '2004-10-20 02:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(966189, 113686, 22046, '<td valign="top">One of the best city shots. Very sharp and clear and good composition with the detailed buildings above the smooth lights reflected inthe river.</td>', 'One of the best city shots. Very sharp and clear and good composition with the detailed buildings above the smooth lights reflected inthe river.', '2004-10-20 02:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(966192, 112357, 22046, '<td valign="top">Fantasy Land... I love it.</td>', 'Fantasy Land... I love it.', '2004-10-20 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(966194, 113315, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very festive feeling to this. Also love the line of band of orange and the band of black with stars.</td>', 'Very festive feeling to this. Also love the line of band of orange and the band of black with stars.', '2004-10-20 02:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(966195, 113621, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field. Love the lights.</td>', 'Great depth of field. Love the lights.', '2004-10-20 02:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(966198, 113366, 22046, '<td valign="top">Different take on the topic. Love the colors and the composition. Also those points of light in the sky.</td>', 'Different take on the topic. Love the colors and the composition. Also those points of light in the sky.', '2004-10-20 02:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(966202, 113167, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a unique take on this theme. Love the sharp focused reflection. Also like the muted color tones with the bright lights.</td>', 'Wow! This is a unique take on this theme. Love the sharp focused reflection. Also like the muted color tones with the bright lights.', '2004-10-20 02:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(966205, 113386, 22046, '<td valign="top">Cool lights and arches.</td>', 'Cool lights and arches.', '2004-10-20 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(966208, 113589, 22046, '<td valign="top">Like the quality of mystery this has.</td>', 'Like the quality of mystery this has.', '2004-10-20 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(966210, 113582, 22046, '<td valign="top">Best fireworks in this challenge because they are so well in focus and you can see each little spark and the great trails of smoke. Color is great too.</td>', 'Best fireworks in this challenge because they are so well in focus and you can see each little spark and the great trails of smoke. Color is great too.', '2004-10-20 02:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(966215, 113024, 22046, '<td valign="top">This one tells a story which adds depth to it. Great use of light, color and composition.</td>', 'This one tells a story which adds depth to it. Great use of light, color and composition.', '2004-10-20 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(966217, 113305, 22046, '<td valign="top">this has a warm feeling to it. Feels like a cozy place to be.</td>', 'this has a warm feeling to it. Feels like a cozy place to be.', '2004-10-20 02:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(966340, 113658, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very well executed, perfectly exposed picture!  Love the tonality!  Great frame within a frame!  Only problem is the frame is empty!  What are we waiting for?  What is coming out of the darkness?  It''s like half a story...  Can''t wait to see the next frame!<br/>TC<br/>PS:  Please don''t ask how long I looked at this waiting for the arrival...</td>', 'This is a very well executed, perfectly exposed picture!  Love the tonality!  Great frame within a frame!  Only problem is the frame is empty!  What are we waiting for?  What is coming out of the darkness?  It''s like half a story...  Can''t wait to see the next frame!TCPS:  Please don''t ask how long I looked at this waiting for the arrival...', '2004-10-20 03:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(966341, 113654, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  What lens did ya use?  The perspective is damn near perfect...</td>', 'Very nice!  What lens did ya use?  The perspective is damn near perfect...', '2004-10-20 03:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(966396, 112433, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and amazingly still water. Could maybe be a bit sharper. 9</td>', 'Very nice photo and amazingly still water. Could maybe be a bit sharper. 9', '2004-10-20 05:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(966407, 113533, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a fab bustly shot.  the bright colours suit the motion blur and the environment very well.  i think i might have preferred it slightly less cluttered (i.e., have just the bus as i think the black hatchback is non-essential here) but that minor criticism aside, i think this works wonderfully well.  very pretty tourist friendly shot. 8.</td>', 'This is a fab bustly shot.  the bright colours suit the motion blur and the environment very well.  i think i might have preferred it slightly less cluttered (i.e., have just the bus as i think the black hatchback is non-essential here) but that minor criticism aside, i think this works wonderfully well.  very pretty tourist friendly shot. 8.', '2004-10-20 06:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(966411, 113429, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is very good.  my only point of real criticism is your inclusion of the muddy bank - it just seems to clash with the very smooth stylish elements of the rest of the picture.  i like very much the colours (all browns and yellows) but one thing i might suggest would be to play with the contrast on the buildings - they just seem a smidgeon bit washed out / greyish to me.  the water is so smooth - you did choose a perfect evening for taking the shot.  it''s lovely - 8.</td>', 'this is very good.  my only point of real criticism is your inclusion of the muddy bank - it just seems to clash with the very smooth stylish elements of the rest of the picture.  i like very much the colours (all browns and yellows) but one thing i might suggest would be to play with the contrast on the buildings - they just seem a smidgeon bit washed out / greyish to me.  the water is so smooth - you did choose a perfect evening for taking the shot.  it''s lovely - 8.', '2004-10-20 06:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(966417, 113362, 16004, '<td valign="top">colours (well the darker shades of grey) seems far too washed out to me - i think the glare from the source of light on the left is a bit over-bearing.  definition also appears a little fuzzy.  having your model step aay from the light a bit, and a jiggle with contrast / brightness might help.  regrettably, i''m not sure that the background suits your guy - sitting at an outdoor cafe in Paris might help (though admittedly given a number limitations might not have been possible).  4.</td>', 'colours (well the darker shades of grey) seems far too washed out to me - i think the glare from the source of light on the left is a bit over-bearing.  definition also appears a little fuzzy.  having your model step aay from the light a bit, and a jiggle with contrast / brightness might help.  regrettably, i''m not sure that the background suits your guy - sitting at an outdoor cafe in Paris might help (though admittedly given a number limitations might not have been possible).  4.', '2004-10-20 06:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(966419, 113658, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good clean image but lacking a bit of interest.</td>', 'Good clean image but lacking a bit of interest.', '2004-10-20 06:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(966421, 113018, 4517, '<td valign="top">I really like this but needs to be cropped off the top and left i think. 8</td>', 'I really like this but needs to be cropped off the top and left i think. 8', '2004-10-20 06:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(966422, 113085, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape.</td>', 'Nice cityscape.', '2004-10-20 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
