(966528, 113670, 27294, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think the composition could have been stronger by cropping off the bottom and top.. but you nearly need them to show that it is a night shot and give it some context.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think the composition could have been stronger by cropping off the bottom and top.. but you nearly need them to show that it is a night shot and give it some context.', '2004-10-20 08:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
