(967051, 113533, 19445, '<td valign="top">good motion - having the bus sharper would have created nice contrast to blurred cars &amp; backround</td>', 'good motion - having the bus sharper would have created nice contrast to blurred cars & backround', '2004-10-20 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(967063, 113195, 19445, '<td valign="top">A little more definition to the smoke cloud would have added to the pic</td>', 'A little more definition to the smoke cloud would have added to the pic', '2004-10-20 15:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(967069, 113503, 16266, '<td valign="top">An allright, image, with decent cropping, but it doens''t have much appeal for me.  It appears there is one direct light sourche which makes for a very contrasty uninteresting image.... i guess the subject doens''t appeal to me that much.. it would take a creative viewpoint to creat interest for me.  Perhaps next time, take an obscure vantage point, or one not normally seen.</td>', 'An allright, image, with decent cropping, but it doens''t have much appeal for me.  It appears there is one direct light sourche which makes for a very contrasty uninteresting image.... i guess the subject doens''t appeal to me that much.. it would take a creative viewpoint to creat interest for me.  Perhaps next time, take an obscure vantage point, or one not normally seen.', '2004-10-20 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(967074, 113485, 16266, '<td valign="top">the direct lighting of the flash makes for a very cotrasty stagnant photo.  The subject is nicely colored, but is the subject is not presented in a way that makes me think, or is anything other than what i would see if i looked at it for one second in real life.  show me something i would miss if i wa walking by.  The image also does not show any ''night'' in it... it just happened to be dark when you shot the image.</td>', 'the direct lighting of the flash makes for a very cotrasty stagnant photo.  The subject is nicely colored, but is the subject is not presented in a way that makes me think, or is anything other than what i would see if i looked at it for one second in real life.  show me something i would miss if i wa walking by.  The image also does not show any ''night'' in it... it just happened to be dark when you shot the image.', '2004-10-20 16:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(967075, 112168, 16266, '<td valign="top">This image is very blurry which is one reason i gave it a low mark.  Perhaps you were wanting to use that as part of the effect, but i don''t feel it helps it at all.  The subject is also placed DIRECTLY in the center of the image which makes for an ''uninteresting'' composition... perhaps if it was moved to the left side more, that would help.</td>', 'This image is very blurry which is one reason i gave it a low mark.  Perhaps you were wanting to use that as part of the effect, but i don''t feel it helps it at all.  The subject is also placed DIRECTLY in the center of the image which makes for an ''uninteresting'' composition... perhaps if it was moved to the left side more, that would help.', '2004-10-20 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(967078, 113141, 19445, '<td valign="top">A darker sky would have made the pic more dramatic</td>', 'A darker sky would have made the pic more dramatic', '2004-10-20 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(967081, 113608, 16266, '<td valign="top">this image is perhaps a tad too light, or low contrast.  It also seems that it was taken with a long delay, with a sligh breeze in the air, creating what seems to be camera shake... which i imageine is not.  I think the biggest problem with this image is the range of shades of black to white.... it seems very middle grey.</td>', 'this image is perhaps a tad too light, or low contrast.  It also seems that it was taken with a long delay, with a sligh breeze in the air, creating what seems to be camera shake... which i imageine is not.  I think the biggest problem with this image is the range of shades of black to white.... it seems very middle grey.', '2004-10-20 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(967084, 113691, 16266, '<td valign="top">Well i suppose this may have been taken ''at night'' but i don''t see any night in this image which i would have liked to.  It is an ok portrait, but perhaps somewhat uninterestingly poses, or shot.  it seems like the very first thing i would think of when taken a picture of someone in this position.  perhaps a different, more obscure viewpoint would have made this image more interesting.</td>', 'Well i suppose this may have been taken ''at night'' but i don''t see any night in this image which i would have liked to.  It is an ok portrait, but perhaps somewhat uninterestingly poses, or shot.  it seems like the very first thing i would think of when taken a picture of someone in this position.  perhaps a different, more obscure viewpoint would have made this image more interesting.', '2004-10-20 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(967129, 113635, 27375, '<td valign="top">this could use some better lighting</td>', 'this could use some better lighting', '2004-10-20 16:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
