(967162, 113330, 27375, '<td valign="top">i have this same picture but i did a close up of john lennon with the flags and a piece of the ferris wheel behind it and it was day time....anyways back to you...this is good ..seems like you had a tiny camera shake. i think a bit more of a crop on the right would help as well</td>', 'i have this same picture but i did a close up of john lennon with the flags and a piece of the ferris wheel behind it and it was day time....anyways back to you...this is good ..seems like you had a tiny camera shake. i think a bit more of a crop on the right would help as well', '2004-10-20 17:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(967199, 113590, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because #1 it''s not very in focus and has no contrast, #2 it''s not very interesting, #3  I can''t realllly tell if it''s a night shot, and #4 it doesn''t look like much of an effort was made...sorry!</td>', 'I''m voting this low because #1 it''s not very in focus and has no contrast, #2 it''s not very interesting, #3  I can''t realllly tell if it''s a night shot, and #4 it doesn''t look like much of an effort was made...sorry!', '2004-10-20 17:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(967203, 112168, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because it really isn''t in focus, it isn''t very interesting, and it doesn''t look like much effort was put into it. Sorry!</td>', 'I''m voting this low because it really isn''t in focus, it isn''t very interesting, and it doesn''t look like much effort was put into it. Sorry!', '2004-10-20 17:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(967205, 113507, 26045, '<td valign="top">A tripod would help!</td>', 'A tripod would help!', '2004-10-20 17:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(967210, 113691, 26045, '<td valign="top">Bedtime isn''t a night shot in my book, so I''m voting this low. They''re still absolute cutiepies, though!</td>', 'Bedtime isn''t a night shot in my book, so I''m voting this low. They''re still absolute cutiepies, though!', '2004-10-20 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(967216, 113398, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because it isn''t really in focus, isn''t very interesting subject matter, isn''t a composed shot, and doesn''t look like you put much effort into it. Sorry!</td>', 'I''m voting this low because it isn''t really in focus, isn''t very interesting subject matter, isn''t a composed shot, and doesn''t look like you put much effort into it. Sorry!', '2004-10-20 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(967224, 113506, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because while it''s a very nice night sky, it still isn''t a very interesting, eye catching, well composed photo...</td>', 'I''m voting this low because while it''s a very nice night sky, it still isn''t a very interesting, eye catching, well composed photo...', '2004-10-20 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(967231, 113680, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because it just isn''t a very interesting photo. What''s the focus here? Is it even nighttime?? I can''t tell by looking at it.</td>', 'I''m voting this low because it just isn''t a very interesting photo. What''s the focus here? Is it even nighttime?? I can''t tell by looking at it.', '2004-10-20 17:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(967242, 113466, 27293, '<td valign="top">Would have been more effective with some blur showing motion or some such. As it is, it''s pretty static.</td>', 'Would have been more effective with some blur showing motion or some such. As it is, it''s pretty static.', '2004-10-20 17:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(967306, 113348, 27293, '<td valign="top">Bumping up to 9, there is nothing that i don''t like here, really, with the exception of the left hand on the steering wheel. I think either more of the driver should be in the picture or none at all. Otherwise, an immaculate shot. Very dynamic and well executed.</td>', 'Bumping up to 9, there is nothing that i don''t like here, really, with the exception of the left hand on the steering wheel. I think either more of the driver should be in the picture or none at all. Otherwise, an immaculate shot. Very dynamic and well executed.', '2004-10-20 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(967312, 113634, 27293, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see the stranger right away, but the rest is pretty impressive.</td>', 'Can''t really see the stranger right away, but the rest is pretty impressive.', '2004-10-20 17:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(967319, 113363, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very appealing composition. I would call this something along the lines of ''a conversation'', because the shot is really about two pairs of people and their shadows talking, not necessarily about the street itself.</td>', 'Very appealing composition. I would call this something along the lines of ''a conversation'', because the shot is really about two pairs of people and their shadows talking, not necessarily about the street itself.', '2004-10-20 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(967324, 113519, 27293, '<td valign="top">Cool! I would make this a vertical shot, though. Almost-square kills the dynamism.</td>', 'Cool! I would make this a vertical shot, though. Almost-square kills the dynamism.', '2004-10-20 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(967330, 113695, 16266, '<td valign="top">I can''t say this is one of my favorites.  I am not sure why.. perhaps it doesn''t hold my interest, I am not sure i see anything sharp.. what am i to look at.  If the image was of fall colors of the tree, perhaps a closer shot of the tree or some leaves might be good... or a tighter crop.  Perhaps it would be interesting if the shot was taken from farther back, where the street light (?) is in the center with the black of the night around it and the tree.</td>', 'I can''t say this is one of my favorites.  I am not sure why.. perhaps it doesn''t hold my interest, I am not sure i see anything sharp.. what am i to look at.  If the image was of fall colors of the tree, perhaps a closer shot of the tree or some leaves might be good... or a tighter crop.  Perhaps it would be interesting if the shot was taken from farther back, where the street light (?) is in the center with the black of the night around it and the tree.', '2004-10-20 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(967334, 112536, 16266, '<td valign="top">ok shot, not sure what to improve, but it doens''t hold impact for me.  Perhaps more negative space at the top.  It is a very busy image.</td>', 'ok shot, not sure what to improve, but it doens''t hold impact for me.  Perhaps more negative space at the top.  It is a very busy image.', '2004-10-20 17:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(967336, 113649, 16266, '<td valign="top">I would sudjest using your limit of 640 pixels wide, that always makes for a more attractive image.  Otherwise, interestingly shot, i like the shadows and variety of light.</td>', 'I would sudjest using your limit of 640 pixels wide, that always makes for a more attractive image.  Otherwise, interestingly shot, i like the shadows and variety of light.', '2004-10-20 18:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(967338, 113340, 16266, '<td valign="top">hmm.... Perhaps this image is too ''smack dab in the face'' for me... perhaps if it was at a bit of an angle, or taken from something other than i would have seen it walking down the street, it would have created more interest.</td>', 'hmm.... Perhaps this image is too ''smack dab in the face'' for me... perhaps if it was at a bit of an angle, or taken from something other than i would have seen it walking down the street, it would have created more interest.', '2004-10-20 18:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(967341, 113507, 280, '<td valign="top">Too much swoosh, very little for the eye to focus on.</td>', 'Too much swoosh, very little for the eye to focus on.', '2004-10-20 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(967343, 113635, 16266, '<td valign="top">This framing is very limiting.  I would like to see more above, or to the left of the pumpkin.  You have the right idea of using the rule of thirds with placing the pumpkin off center, but it is much too tightly cropped around the rest of it.  At least a little more information (space around the pumpkin) would be good.</td>', 'This framing is very limiting.  I would like to see more above, or to the left of the pumpkin.  You have the right idea of using the rule of thirds with placing the pumpkin off center, but it is much too tightly cropped around the rest of it.  At least a little more information (space around the pumpkin) would be good.', '2004-10-20 18:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(967344, 113681, 3569, '<td valign="top">No point for my eye to go to except flash lit branch, kind of chaiotic, Needs a subject to draw too.</td>', 'No point for my eye to go to except flash lit branch, kind of chaiotic, Needs a subject to draw too.', '2004-10-20 18:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(967345, 113696, 3569, '<td valign="top">would have been more interesting if the headlights would have met the tailights somewhere in the shot. They reall don''t meet like the title.</td>', 'would have been more interesting if the headlights would have met the tailights somewhere in the shot. They reall don''t meet like the title.', '2004-10-20 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(967347, 113117, 3569, '<td valign="top">I see what you want, but to me it doesn''t work well.  Possibly to busy or no eye directing subject.</td>', 'I see what you want, but to me it doesn''t work well.  Possibly to busy or no eye directing subject.', '2004-10-20 18:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(967348, 113589, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic!</td>', 'this is fantastic!', '2004-10-20 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(967349, 113507, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but to me not much value to vote on.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but to me not much value to vote on.', '2004-10-20 18:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(967350, 112168, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus appears to be a bit off to me</td>', 'focus appears to be a bit off to me', '2004-10-20 18:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(967352, 113099, 3569, '<td valign="top">great flash usage, but I hate off centered buildings, signs, streets, etc.  just me.</td>', 'great flash usage, but I hate off centered buildings, signs, streets, etc.  just me.', '2004-10-20 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(967354, 112168, 280, '<td valign="top">Lacking focus and it seems to me that there was very little though that went in to the composition, I would have preferred to see it positioned slightly off centre.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lacking focus and it seems to me that there was very little though that went in to the composition, I would have preferred to see it positioned slightly off centre. ', '2004-10-20 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(967356, 112937, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful photo, if i had to pick something that could be better it would be the flag, id like to see it clearly</td>', 'this is a wonderful photo, if i had to pick something that could be better it would be the flag, id like to see it clearly', '2004-10-20 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(967357, 113363, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO this off angle doesn''t work  here.  Not sure what the subject is, is it the cig., butt, or is it she hooker getting a John...</td>', 'IMO this off angle doesn''t work  here.  Not sure what the subject is, is it the cig., butt, or is it she hooker getting a John...', '2004-10-20 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(967358, 113429, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO the shot is too overexposed.  You have lost a great deal of detail.  A few seconds less, may be best.</td>', 'IMO the shot is too overexposed.  You have lost a great deal of detail.  A few seconds less, may be best.', '2004-10-20 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(967360, 113388, 27375, '<td valign="top">the border color blends in with the stone a little, perhaps a different color and tighter crop.....interesting shot though</td>', 'the border color blends in with the stone a little, perhaps a different color and tighter crop.....interesting shot though', '2004-10-20 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(967361, 113359, 3569, '<td valign="top">Too snapshotty to me, Next time get in a bit closer and show us something</td>', 'Too snapshotty to me, Next time get in a bit closer and show us something', '2004-10-20 18:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(967362, 113467, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the masts and the big pole make a nice diamond shape that really makes the composition super. Nicely burned in too. Reflection is nice and clear and the exposure on the boats is good. You really know how to work the camera. Congrats.</td>', 'Very nice, the masts and the big pole make a nice diamond shape that really makes the composition super. Nicely burned in too. Reflection is nice and clear and the exposure on the boats is good. You really know how to work the camera. Congrats.', '2004-10-20 18:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(967363, 113363, 7543, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the voters in general will love this one, but I think it''s really good. The suggestive out-of-frame feeling gives you a pretty good idea about whats going on above. Really sharp and the duotone works out perfectly. Very tasteful.</td>', 'I don''t think the voters in general will love this one, but I think it''s really good. The suggestive out-of-frame feeling gives you a pretty good idea about whats going on above. Really sharp and the duotone works out perfectly. Very tasteful.', '2004-10-20 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(967364, 113519, 3569, '<td valign="top">Not sure where to look, my eye is all over the place..  either the face or the yoyo needs to be reduced in intenseness to move the eye to a direct subject and the other as a modifier.  Just my opinion</td>', 'Not sure where to look, my eye is all over the place..  either the face or the yoyo needs to be reduced in intenseness to move the eye to a direct subject and the other as a modifier.  Just my opinion', '2004-10-20 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(967368, 112927, 3569, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shades and contrasts.  Niced shot.  After reviewing the challenge, your is the best.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Beautiful shades and contrasts.  Niced shot.  After reviewing the challenge, your is the best.  Good Luck.', '2004-10-20 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(967369, 113504, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is so awesome the way the weeds look like trees... it has such a "haunted house" feel to it as well you might get hassled for the green sky but i think this is so intereesting.. one of my favorites so far</td>', 'this is so awesome the way the weeds look like trees... it has such a "haunted house" feel to it as well you might get hassled for the green sky but i think this is so intereesting.. one of my favorites so far', '2004-10-20 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(967371, 113569, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good idea, very nicely carried out. The even lumination on the foreground pines is just perfect. Good contrast to the dark background.</td>', 'Good idea, very nicely carried out. The even lumination on the foreground pines is just perfect. Good contrast to the dark background.', '2004-10-20 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(967372, 113695, 27375, '<td valign="top">there are a few spooky photos on here and this one is very nice...this may be neat with a scary leg stepping into the shot from the shadows...</td>', 'there are a few spooky photos on here and this one is very nice...this may be neat with a scary leg stepping into the shot from the shadows...', '2004-10-20 18:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(967374, 113607, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is cool and the title fits it very well, possibly some more interesting chairs. the salt shaker that has fallen over is a nice touch,</td>', 'this is cool and the title fits it very well, possibly some more interesting chairs. the salt shaker that has fallen over is a nice touch,', '2004-10-20 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(967376, 113348, 27375, '<td valign="top">you know this is good, i dont have to tell you...its perfect!</td>', 'you know this is good, i dont have to tell you...its perfect!', '2004-10-20 18:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
