(967494, 113634, 10390, '<td valign="top">mystic, I like it, It''s in the highest class in this challenge imo.</td>', 'mystic, I like it, It''s in the highest class in this challenge imo.', '2004-10-20 20:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(967498, 113506, 10390, '<td valign="top">Look at the stars.... there''s a sign. Outstanding sign-shot, one of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Look at the stars.... there''s a sign. Outstanding sign-shot, one of my favourites in this challenge.', '2004-10-20 20:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(967500, 113220, 10390, '<td valign="top">Beautiful city shot, very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful city shot, very nice.', '2004-10-20 20:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(967501, 113532, 13610, '<td valign="top">Interesting view. As a suggestion I''d propose to re-shoot it when it''s not garbage day and converted in B&amp;W this would be amazing.</td>', 'Interesting view. As a suggestion I''d propose to re-shoot it when it''s not garbage day and converted in B&W this would be amazing.', '2004-10-20 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(967503, 112717, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good photo, good composition, nice color, one of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Good photo, good composition, nice color, one of my favourites in this challenge.', '2004-10-20 20:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(967504, 112717, 13610, '<td valign="top">This is very original.</td>', 'This is very original.', '2004-10-20 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(967505, 112357, 10390, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, one of the best in this challenge, definately a top 10 image, I would guess a ribbon even.</td>', 'A beautiful image, one of the best in this challenge, definately a top 10 image, I would guess a ribbon even.', '2004-10-20 20:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(967510, 112790, 10390, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me of the cover/poster of the film "Mystic River". Great photo.</td>', 'This photo reminds me of the cover/poster of the film "Mystic River". Great photo.', '2004-10-20 20:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(967519, 113263, 10390, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea, I like this shot a lot, very clever!</td>', 'Awesome idea, I like this shot a lot, very clever!', '2004-10-20 20:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(967521, 113388, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very funny, ROCK ON!</td>', 'Very funny, ROCK ON!', '2004-10-20 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(967526, 113624, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good lighting condition and composition, maybe it would be better with all of the fiddle in the frame...  ...or maybe not, this is just great as it is, bumping up.</td>', 'Good lighting condition and composition, maybe it would be better with all of the fiddle in the frame...  ...or maybe not, this is just great as it is, bumping up.', '2004-10-20 20:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(967529, 113475, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, maybe a bit too long exposure, otherwise I like the framing.</td>', 'Nice photo, maybe a bit too long exposure, otherwise I like the framing.', '2004-10-20 20:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(967533, 113688, 8614, '<td valign="top">Great reflections. The title is fitting,</td>', 'Great reflections. The title is fitting,', '2004-10-20 20:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(967536, 113315, 21714, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Colours, shapes, lighting and perspective - nicely captured. It''s my top pick. Hope you ribbon. 10.</td>', 'I love this image. Colours, shapes, lighting and perspective - nicely captured. It''s my top pick. Hope you ribbon. 10.', '2004-10-20 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(967540, 113024, 21714, '<td valign="top">This image made me stop. It made me think and analyze.  Absolutely love the angle and composition - the way you have captures space and scale with the main subject, the person.  I do feel that making it a bit darker would make a bigger impact thought. Having said that, I am fine with how it is now. One of my top picks for a ribbon. Best of luck.</td>', 'This image made me stop. It made me think and analyze.  Absolutely love the angle and composition - the way you have captures space and scale with the main subject, the person.  I do feel that making it a bit darker would make a bigger impact thought. Having said that, I am fine with how it is now. One of my top picks for a ribbon. Best of luck.', '2004-10-20 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(967572, 113142, 21714, '<td valign="top">I do find things wrong with the quality of the image. Would have liked it to be a bit sharper without the weird patches in the background. Without those, I think thiswould have been  one of the best images in the challenges. Love the composition and the lighting. I love the atmosphere it creates.</td>', 'I do find things wrong with the quality of the image. Would have liked it to be a bit sharper without the weird patches in the background. Without those, I think thiswould have been  one of the best images in the challenges. Love the composition and the lighting. I love the atmosphere it creates.', '2004-10-20 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(967578, 113336, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the mix of colours here.  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the mix of colours here.  Great shot!', '2004-10-20 21:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(967579, 113607, 21714, '<td valign="top">This image takes me there. It makes a connection with me. I feel like I can walk in there. It''s 2 plastic chairs and a table, yet they look lonely, bored and unwanted. <br/>It''s the light that creates the atmosphere and you have captured it well. This might sound weird but I find it very touching. There''s something about it that makes me feel for it. :)<br/>Best of luck.</td>', 'This image takes me there. It makes a connection with me. I feel like I can walk in there. It''s 2 plastic chairs and a table, yet they look lonely, bored and unwanted. It''s the light that creates the atmosphere and you have captured it well. This might sound weird but I find it very touching. There''s something about it that makes me feel for it. :)Best of luck.', '2004-10-20 21:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(967580, 113211, 21714, '<td valign="top">5 in the morning and you hit the ceiling? :) Been there. <br/>I like the composition but I feel that it could have been made better with bumping up the contrast or something else to liven it up a bit.</td>', '5 in the morning and you hit the ceiling? :) Been there. I like the composition but I feel that it could have been made better with bumping up the contrast or something else to liven it up a bit.', '2004-10-20 21:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
