(967867, 113504, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  I find the bright light over the building (lighthouse maybe) a bit distracting, and I might have chosen to edit out the electric poles, but I really like the creative angle.  Very nice.  I think it will probably place well.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  I find the bright light over the building (lighthouse maybe) a bit distracting, and I might have chosen to edit out the electric poles, but I really like the creative angle.  Very nice.  I think it will probably place well.', '2004-10-21 02:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(967869, 113127, 25464, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous example of a night shot.  The water is amazing.</td>', 'Gorgeous example of a night shot.  The water is amazing.', '2004-10-21 02:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(967875, 113666, 27246, '<td valign="top">Probably purposeful, but I think the tilted horizon detracts from an otherwise great shot</td>', 'Probably purposeful, but I think the tilted horizon detracts from an otherwise great shot', '2004-10-21 02:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(967879, 113606, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this shot.  I think the composition is a bit off though.  It seems really heavy on the right. Perhaps a lower angle would have created the illusion of taller lamp posts to even things out.  This looks very similar to another entry showing both sides of the street (I will have to look again), which made for a better comp.  I do like the pattern of the sidewalk illuminated in this shot.  Overall good job.</td>', 'I like the mood of this shot.  I think the composition is a bit off though.  It seems really heavy on the right. Perhaps a lower angle would have created the illusion of taller lamp posts to even things out.  This looks very similar to another entry showing both sides of the street (I will have to look again), which made for a better comp.  I do like the pattern of the sidewalk illuminated in this shot.  Overall good job.', '2004-10-21 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(967883, 113259, 25464, '<td valign="top">The water is perfect, and I like the effect on the lights.  Subject, while different, is a little boring for me, but a very well taken example of a night shot.</td>', 'The water is perfect, and I like the effect on the lights.  Subject, while different, is a little boring for me, but a very well taken example of a night shot.', '2004-10-21 02:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(967886, 113167, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  A less centered, perhaps even angled, approach might have added even more interest, but I like it.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  A less centered, perhaps even angled, approach might have added even more interest, but I like it.  Good job.', '2004-10-21 02:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(967887, 112433, 25464, '<td valign="top">NIce colors and reflections.  I like the hint of cloud in the sky as well.</td>', 'NIce colors and reflections.  I like the hint of cloud in the sky as well.', '2004-10-21 02:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(967890, 113582, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Not a fan of the red border, but I like the style chosen for this shot.  This may have been more interesting with an angled approach.  Still, very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.  Not a fan of the red border, but I like the style chosen for this shot.  This may have been more interesting with an angled approach.  Still, very nice.', '2004-10-21 02:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(967900, 113666, 25464, '<td valign="top">Oh no.  You used the word sunset.  I hope you are not getting bashed too drastically for that.  The composition is a bit off because the water looks tilted and the treeline looks tilted in the other direction.  Not real sure what is going on there?  Also, the water seems a bit too green in relation to the color of the sky.  Other than those distractions, pretty nice.</td>', 'Oh no.  You used the word sunset.  I hope you are not getting bashed too drastically for that.  The composition is a bit off because the water looks tilted and the treeline looks tilted in the other direction.  Not real sure what is going on there?  Also, the water seems a bit too green in relation to the color of the sky.  Other than those distractions, pretty nice.', '2004-10-21 02:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(967903, 113367, 25464, '<td valign="top">A very nice sunset.  I wont bash you for having light in the sky.  Not one of those guys. However, I think this needs something more.  The sky is beautiful but a little boring.</td>', 'A very nice sunset.  I wont bash you for having light in the sky.  Not one of those guys. However, I think this needs something more.  The sky is beautiful but a little boring.', '2004-10-21 02:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
