(967952, 113485, 25464, '<td valign="top">I dont think this was the best choice for a night shot.  The flash is too overpowering, and makes it almost impossible to see it as a night shot.</td>', 'I dont think this was the best choice for a night shot.  The flash is too overpowering, and makes it almost impossible to see it as a night shot.', '2004-10-21 02:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
