(968781, 113634, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is good, i made a few comments to some other pictures similar to this that it would be more interesting with a subject like a stray dog or cat, but a man in a trench coat does this well.  im not sure what s going on with the tilt feeling i get here but its still a very nice photo. the broken wooden fence is a good element as well</td>', 'this is good, i made a few comments to some other pictures similar to this that it would be more interesting with a subject like a stray dog or cat, but a man in a trench coat does this well.  im not sure what s going on with the tilt feeling i get here but its still a very nice photo. the broken wooden fence is a good element as well', '2004-10-21 17:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
