(968831, 113503, 25042, '<td valign="top">The focus and DOF in the photo are very good. But I dont see how the shot being take at night really adds anything to the photo.</td>', 'The focus and DOF in the photo are very good. But I dont see how the shot being take at night really adds anything to the photo.', '2004-10-21 17:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(968839, 113485, 20539, '<td valign="top">a flash photo of a couple of leaves isnt going to cut it for this challenge. people were looking more for a shot where the nighttime is actually visible. for all we know this could be broad daylight (although it looks like nighttime with flash).</td>', 'a flash photo of a couple of leaves isnt going to cut it for this challenge. people were looking more for a shot where the nighttime is actually visible. for all we know this could be broad daylight (although it looks like nighttime with flash).', '2004-10-21 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(968845, 113559, 20539, '<td valign="top">great perspective. nice sky. all in all a well executed original shot. the moonlight makes it really great.</td>', 'great perspective. nice sky. all in all a well executed original shot. the moonlight makes it really great.', '2004-10-21 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(968846, 113259, 20539, '<td valign="top">great capture. the stars are quite nice in this photo. 8</td>', 'great capture. the stars are quite nice in this photo. 8', '2004-10-21 18:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(968851, 113691, 20539, '<td valign="top">hmm, im sorry, i can award high marks on this. i see their ready for bed, but an indoor shot of kids for a nighttime challenge doesnt work too well.</td>', 'hmm, im sorry, i can award high marks on this. i see their ready for bed, but an indoor shot of kids for a nighttime challenge doesnt work too well.', '2004-10-21 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(968854, 113517, 20539, '<td valign="top">crazyness! looks like the citys on fire! nice effect, although the long exposure caused a bit of overexposure in the city. but its worth it to have those smoke-flames!</td>', 'crazyness! looks like the citys on fire! nice effect, although the long exposure caused a bit of overexposure in the city. but its worth it to have those smoke-flames!', '2004-10-21 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(968856, 113581, 20539, '<td valign="top">watch the camera movements. it can be tricky on long-exposure shots.</td>', 'watch the camera movements. it can be tricky on long-exposure shots.', '2004-10-21 18:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(968857, 113696, 20539, '<td valign="top">theres not enough interest in this shot. its not a shot that will ''wow'' the viewer, mainly because you cant really associate yourself with the image.</td>', 'theres not enough interest in this shot. its not a shot that will ''wow'' the viewer, mainly because you cant really associate yourself with the image.', '2004-10-21 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(968908, 113533, 15703, '<td valign="top">I love this a lot.</td>', 'I love this a lot.', '2004-10-21 18:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(968912, 113518, 15703, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Bags of mild, wet, drizzly mood.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Bags of mild, wet, drizzly mood.', '2004-10-21 18:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(968952, 113672, 3707, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and contrast.  Although I think it is visually appealing, it does speak volumes of our lack of respect for energy consumption.</td>', 'Nice lines and contrast.  Although I think it is visually appealing, it does speak volumes of our lack of respect for energy consumption.', '2004-10-21 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(968985, 113581, 22748, '<td valign="top">Looks like some camera shake? Maybe a tripod would help.</td>', 'Looks like some camera shake? Maybe a tripod would help.', '2004-10-21 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(968986, 113097, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, nifty lighting!</td>', 'Wow, nifty lighting!', '2004-10-21 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(968987, 113485, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice color but too bad about the ugly harsh shadows made by the flash.</td>', 'Nice color but too bad about the ugly harsh shadows made by the flash.', '2004-10-21 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(968995, 112544, 16493, '<td valign="top">looks good but is a bit too dark to do extreamly well.</td>', 'looks good but is a bit too dark to do extreamly well.', '2004-10-21 20:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(969056, 112927, 10402, '<td valign="top">Slightly skewed and not very sharp, but it has nice detail. Successfully shows off the elegant grandeur of this building.</td>', 'Slightly skewed and not very sharp, but it has nice detail. Successfully shows off the elegant grandeur of this building.', '2004-10-21 21:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(969066, 113670, 10402, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition of reflections and transparency gives an interesting ambiguity. There is a lot to see here (that will bother some people, but I like it). What it lacks is a center of interest, a resting place for the eye as the viewer explores the many details.</td>', 'The juxtaposition of reflections and transparency gives an interesting ambiguity. There is a lot to see here (that will bother some people, but I like it). What it lacks is a center of interest, a resting place for the eye as the viewer explores the many details.', '2004-10-21 21:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(969073, 113663, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but the implied lines of the fountain leads the eye to the waterfall which is unfortunately cut off.</td>', 'Beautiful, but the implied lines of the fountain leads the eye to the waterfall which is unfortunately cut off.', '2004-10-21 21:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(969084, 113643, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice color and great perspective. The contrast between the right and left sides is interesting and the composition is well balanced. The slight slant is distracting.</td>', 'Nice color and great perspective. The contrast between the right and left sides is interesting and the composition is well balanced. The slight slant is distracting.', '2004-10-21 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(969111, 113440, 24065, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the brick thing at the bottom had been cropped out.  The top part of the photo is beautiful!</td>', 'I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the brick thing at the bottom had been cropped out.  The top part of the photo is beautiful!', '2004-10-21 22:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(969114, 113485, 24065, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the fill light had not been so bright.  It loses the night-shot effect for me.</td>', 'I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the fill light had not been so bright.  It loses the night-shot effect for me.', '2004-10-21 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(969118, 113581, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very OOF, other than that I would have placed the tower off center with possibly some negative space to the left of the church.</td>', 'Very OOF, other than that I would have placed the tower off center with possibly some negative space to the left of the church.', '2004-10-21 22:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(969119, 113350, 24065, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the shutter had not been left open for quite as long.  The street lights are just a bit too glaring.</td>', 'I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the shutter had not been left open for quite as long.  The street lights are just a bit too glaring.', '2004-10-21 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(969123, 113329, 24065, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the shutter had not been left open for quite as long.  The lamp is a bit too glaring for my personal taste.</td>', 'I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if the shutter had not been left open for quite as long.  The lamp is a bit too glaring for my personal taste.', '2004-10-21 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(969124, 113440, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  The lighted stone in the bottom left is just perfect imo.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  The lighted stone in the bottom left is just perfect imo.', '2004-10-21 22:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(969126, 113366, 24065, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the photo AND the title!  BOL :D</td>', 'Wow!  I love the photo AND the title!  BOL :D', '2004-10-21 22:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(969128, 113620, 26500, '<td valign="top">The parked car is somewhat distracting othwise nice job.</td>', 'The parked car is somewhat distracting othwise nice job.', '2004-10-21 22:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(969133, 112357, 24065, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Can''t wait to see where this was taken.  Beautiful!</td>', 'WOW!  Can''t wait to see where this was taken.  Beautiful!', '2004-10-21 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(969138, 112652, 24065, '<td valign="top">I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if more had been cropped off the right side. I really like the leaf-lined sidewalk and the colors.</td>', 'I hesitate to offer a suggestion because I am still so inexperienced, but I personally would have liked it better if more had been cropped off the right side. I really like the leaf-lined sidewalk and the colors.', '2004-10-21 22:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(969140, 113097, 27764, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors, everything is so bright!</td>', 'Awesome colors, everything is so bright!', '2004-10-21 22:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(969141, 113649, 26500, '<td valign="top">Way to dark imo.</td>', 'Way to dark imo.', '2004-10-21 22:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(969142, 113363, 24065, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the sidewalk are fascinating!</td>', 'The shadows on the sidewalk are fascinating!', '2004-10-21 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(969144, 113536, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cool leading line I like it.</td>', 'Cool leading line I like it.', '2004-10-21 22:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969147, 113504, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The northern lights?  My only suggestion for improvement would be to leave the shutter open a little shorter time -- the one light is a bit too glaring for me.  Otherwise, I really like it!  BOL :D</td>', 'Very nice.  The northern lights?  My only suggestion for improvement would be to leave the shutter open a little shorter time -- the one light is a bit too glaring for me.  Otherwise, I really like it!  BOL :D', '2004-10-21 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(969148, 112773, 24065, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look to happy to be photographed!  Hope you were safe in your car ;-)  Very good focus and composition.</td>', 'He doesn''t look to happy to be photographed!  Hope you were safe in your car ;-)  Very good focus and composition.', '2004-10-21 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(969168, 112695, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrayal of "evening". Great color contrast between the sky and the scene. The kids watching the fountain is a very nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice portrayal of "evening". Great color contrast between the sky and the scene. The kids watching the fountain is a very nice touch.', '2004-10-21 22:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(969189, 112718, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition in a nice setting. But the motion blur seems accidental; I think either a faster shutter speed to freeze the motion or a slower one to make it deliberate would have been more effective. But it''s a minor flaw; overall I really like this photo.</td>', 'Great composition in a nice setting. But the motion blur seems accidental; I think either a faster shutter speed to freeze the motion or a slower one to make it deliberate would have been more effective. But it''s a minor flaw; overall I really like this photo.', '2004-10-21 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(969190, 113319, 2567, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Terrific shot!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-10-21 22:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969229, 113533, 2022, '<td valign="top">Very nice, bumping from 9 to 10.</td>', 'Very nice, bumping from 9 to 10.', '2004-10-21 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(969231, 113348, 25150, '<td valign="top">a very crisp and clean example of a classic cliché shot. Very well done!</td>', 'a very crisp and clean example of a classic cliché shot. Very well done!', '2004-10-21 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969232, 112657, 25150, '<td valign="top">good use of a long exposure. the confusion theme really works well for this type of shot.</td>', 'good use of a long exposure. the confusion theme really works well for this type of shot.', '2004-10-21 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(969235, 113127, 25150, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo. not much else to say!</td>', 'wonderful photo. not much else to say!', '2004-10-21 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(969238, 113024, 25150, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you had this validated? the soft colors are terrific in this shot. There seems to be a halo around his head. Did you dodge it out? if so, maybe a smaller brush would have worked better. This is one of my favorites of the challenge, and I hope you do well.</td>', 'I wonder why you had this validated? the soft colors are terrific in this shot. There seems to be a halo around his head. Did you dodge it out? if so, maybe a smaller brush would have worked better. This is one of my favorites of the challenge, and I hope you do well.', '2004-10-21 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(969239, 113519, 25150, '<td valign="top">it''s so freaky!<br/>I love it!<br/>the look on the models face really makes this photo. and the blue tint, excellent!</td>', 'it''s so freaky!I love it!the look on the models face really makes this photo. and the blue tint, excellent!', '2004-10-21 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(969243, 113517, 25150, '<td valign="top">It''s a terrific shot, but I don''t really think the crop works for it. maybe less bottom, and more sky? anyways, great photo overall! high marks :)</td>', 'It''s a terrific shot, but I don''t really think the crop works for it. maybe less bottom, and more sky? anyways, great photo overall! high marks :)', '2004-10-21 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(969244, 113429, 25150, '<td valign="top">I really like this and am bumping it up. I hope you win a ribbon. The yellow really makes it pop out. I wish it was a little sharper though.<br/>good choice of color :)</td>', 'I really like this and am bumping it up. I hope you win a ribbon. The yellow really makes it pop out. I wish it was a little sharper though.good choice of color :)', '2004-10-21 23:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(969245, 113495, 25150, '<td valign="top">you know this is beautiful, so there isn''t much i can really say, is there?<br/>good shot :)</td>', 'you know this is beautiful, so there isn''t much i can really say, is there?good shot :)', '2004-10-21 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(969259, 112433, 24384, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!</td>', 'beautiful shot!', '2004-10-21 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(969273, 113621, 23680, '<td valign="top">I just love the perspective on this - one of my tops of this challenge</td>', 'I just love the perspective on this - one of my tops of this challenge', '2004-10-22 00:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(969276, 113691, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but how is the viewer to tell this was shot at night?</td>', 'I like the colors, but how is the viewer to tell this was shot at night?', '2004-10-22 00:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(969277, 113649, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very dark, I know it is a night challenge, but I can hardly make out any details at all - sorry</td>', 'Very dark, I know it is a night challenge, but I can hardly make out any details at all - sorry', '2004-10-22 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(969279, 113532, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but something about this picture is making me dizzy, I guess it''s the angle of the buildings on the right combined with the leaning cars and the angle of the houses directly in front, just too much going on I guess - sorry</td>', 'I like your idea but something about this picture is making me dizzy, I guess it''s the angle of the buildings on the right combined with the leaning cars and the angle of the houses directly in front, just too much going on I guess - sorry', '2004-10-22 00:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(969283, 113607, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like the tones but it is just not very interesting to me</td>', 'I like the tones but it is just not very interesting to me', '2004-10-22 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(969284, 113587, 23680, '<td valign="top">This would have been great if it were more in focus, I like the contrast of the colors and the lights</td>', 'This would have been great if it were more in focus, I like the contrast of the colors and the lights', '2004-10-22 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969286, 113336, 23680, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better if you had a closer crop on the left so that only the house was showing, my eyes are drawn to the tree and space with no lights</td>', 'I think this might have worked better if you had a closer crop on the left so that only the house was showing, my eyes are drawn to the tree and space with no lights', '2004-10-22 00:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(969289, 113141, 23680, '<td valign="top">Great job, I really, really like this for many reasons - the composition, the colors, the lighting and there is just something about pumpkins that make me smile :)</td>', 'Great job, I really, really like this for many reasons - the composition, the colors, the lighting and there is just something about pumpkins that make me smile :)', '2004-10-22 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(969290, 113352, 23680, '<td valign="top">Wow - great job</td>', 'Wow - great job', '2004-10-22 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(969291, 113581, 26756, '<td valign="top">Not a bad subject, the exposure is pretty good but it''s just a bit too blurry to rate a very high score.</td>', 'Not a bad subject, the exposure is pretty good but it''s just a bit too blurry to rate a very high score.', '2004-10-22 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(969292, 113366, 23680, '<td valign="top">This grabbed me in the thumbnail and definitely did not disappoint - something different, great colors and angle 10</td>', 'This grabbed me in the thumbnail and definitely did not disappoint - something different, great colors and angle 10', '2004-10-22 00:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(969296, 113331, 23680, '<td valign="top">Good job, maybe a little closer crop on the right, just to remove the bench</td>', 'Good job, maybe a little closer crop on the right, just to remove the bench', '2004-10-22 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(969300, 113359, 23680, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot', '2004-10-22 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(969339, 113674, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the broken reflection.</td>', 'I love the broken reflection.', '2004-10-22 01:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(969343, 112940, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really cool</td>', 'Really cool', '2004-10-22 01:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(969350, 113398, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t find myself very interested in a couple cars in a parking lot.  The lens flares are pretty severe too, but depending on your type of camera, there may not be anything you can do about it.  One the positve side, the colors are very nice.</td>', 'I don''t find myself very interested in a couple cars in a parking lot.  The lens flares are pretty severe too, but depending on your type of camera, there may not be anything you can do about it.  One the positve side, the colors are very nice.', '2004-10-22 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(969352, 113536, 18799, '<td valign="top">The sepia works here.  Nice job</td>', 'The sepia works here.  Nice job', '2004-10-22 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(969353, 113475, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little too overexposed.</td>', 'I think it''s a little too overexposed.', '2004-10-22 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(969359, 112536, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great reflection pattern.  I think the bright light in under the far peak could have been toned down, or removed as this is advanced editing because I find it a little distracting.  But still, I like the photo - 7</td>', 'Great reflection pattern.  I think the bright light in under the far peak could have been toned down, or removed as this is advanced editing because I find it a little distracting.  But still, I like the photo - 7', '2004-10-22 01:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(969361, 113171, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2004-10-22 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(969364, 113497, 18799, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more of the church.  You nailed the exposure though.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more of the church.  You nailed the exposure though.', '2004-10-22 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(969368, 113701, 18799, '<td valign="top">The flash is really harsh, and that actually works for this photo.  Kind of a Blair Witch Project look to it.  I wouldn''t want to go in there!</td>', 'The flash is really harsh, and that actually works for this photo.  Kind of a Blair Witch Project look to it.  I wouldn''t want to go in there!', '2004-10-22 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(969373, 113532, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting color - is that a filter effect, or pollution?  I love the narrow streets and will be interested to find out where this was taken once the challenge is over.  7</td>', 'Interesting color - is that a filter effect, or pollution?  I love the narrow streets and will be interested to find out where this was taken once the challenge is over.  7', '2004-10-22 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(969375, 113329, 18799, '<td valign="top">The light is way to bright.  It''s hard to look at anything else in the photo when there is something that bright screaming for your attention.</td>', 'The light is way to bright.  It''s hard to look at anything else in the photo when there is something that bright screaming for your attention.', '2004-10-22 01:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(969378, 113507, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract work.  I don''t know how it will play in this challenge, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice abstract work.  I don''t know how it will play in this challenge, but I like it a lot.', '2004-10-22 01:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(969383, 113220, 18799, '<td valign="top">The detail and focus is really good.  The composition suffers though (IMO) from too much sky and too little cityscape.  All that sky doesn''t add anything of interest to the image and as they say, if it doesn''t add, then it detracts.</td>', 'The detail and focus is really good.  The composition suffers though (IMO) from too much sky and too little cityscape.  All that sky doesn''t add anything of interest to the image and as they say, if it doesn''t add, then it detracts.', '2004-10-22 01:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969386, 113672, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometric shapes in this photograph.</td>', 'Interesting geometric shapes in this photograph.', '2004-10-22 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(969395, 112795, 18799, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2004-10-22 01:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(969398, 113651, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a good night shot but what stands out for me is that there is an odd transition one third of the way from the top. I think you would have been better off by cropping that out.</td>', 'This is a good night shot but what stands out for me is that there is an odd transition one third of the way from the top. I think you would have been better off by cropping that out.', '2004-10-22 01:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(969399, 113666, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really nice exposure  and angle of view</td>', 'Really nice exposure  and angle of view', '2004-10-22 01:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(969402, 113679, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a flash or not, but the bright foreground is distracting.  I would have preferred a long exposure</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a flash or not, but the bright foreground is distracting.  I would have preferred a long exposure', '2004-10-22 01:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(969403, 113168, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think there is way too much sky in this photograph.  The sky doesn''t have any color or texture that adds value, so I would have cropped most of it out.</td>', 'I think there is way too much sky in this photograph.  The sky doesn''t have any color or texture that adds value, so I would have cropped most of it out.', '2004-10-22 01:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(969404, 113652, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a good image.  What would have made it a great image (IMO) would have been cropping it a lot tighter.</td>', 'This is a good image.  What would have made it a great image (IMO) would have been cropping it a lot tighter.', '2004-10-22 01:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(969425, 113475, 20539, '<td valign="top">looks like a painting. good work</td>', 'looks like a painting. good work', '2004-10-22 02:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(969426, 113651, 20539, '<td valign="top">the image should be darkened a bit... thats what i think. good work</td>', 'the image should be darkened a bit... thats what i think. good work', '2004-10-22 02:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(969429, 112937, 20539, '<td valign="top">good choice with b&amp;w, but the exposure seems a touch too long... it removes detail in the picture</td>', 'good choice with b&w, but the exposure seems a touch too long... it removes detail in the picture', '2004-10-22 02:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(969430, 113142, 20539, '<td valign="top">i like the old look. fits nicely</td>', 'i like the old look. fits nicely', '2004-10-22 02:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(969432, 112433, 11895, '<td valign="top">this seems like it would benefit from being shot at closer range and not having quite so much in the frame, it is a little busy and lacks sharpness; the reflections are a plus</td>', 'this seems like it would benefit from being shot at closer range and not having quite so much in the frame, it is a little busy and lacks sharpness; the reflections are a plus', '2004-10-22 02:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(969443, 113628, 27847, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, very well done. The color is great, especially for the stained glass window ''Eye of the Beholder''!? I see even a star snuck in. Great Job!</td>', 'I really like this shot, very well done. The color is great, especially for the stained glass window ''Eye of the Beholder''!? I see even a star snuck in. Great Job!', '2004-10-22 02:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(969445, 113536, 27847, '<td valign="top">Really nice work here, old street in Paris?  ;-) Focus throughout, and the street light really add to the atmosphere.</td>', 'Really nice work here, old street in Paris?  ;-) Focus throughout, and the street light really add to the atmosphere.', '2004-10-22 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
