(969503, 113494, 16004, '<td valign="top">cool building that''s been well captured here.  i especially love the sail-type structure, and how it''s been lit up.  the white and creams against the pitch black sky is very effective, as is the rest of the structure with the row of lights and windows...  I think the inclusion of the landscaping and footpaths lessens the drama and impact of the architecture a bit, i might have tried to see what it looked like by cropping horzintally along the bottom edge of the entrance doors.  and crop out some of the bridge.  it would look convincingly like a space station then!  wonderful building.  is it as similarly stylish inside too?  8.</td>', 'cool building that''s been well captured here.  i especially love the sail-type structure, and how it''s been lit up.  the white and creams against the pitch black sky is very effective, as is the rest of the structure with the row of lights and windows...  I think the inclusion of the landscaping and footpaths lessens the drama and impact of the architecture a bit, i might have tried to see what it looked like by cropping horzintally along the bottom edge of the entrance doors.  and crop out some of the bridge.  it would look convincingly like a space station then!  wonderful building.  is it as similarly stylish inside too?  8.', '2004-10-22 03:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(969506, 113433, 24128, '<td valign="top">The extra sky on the left really works to give the building a sense of presence, the lamp serves to provide an almost ironic illusion of lighting the building - very creative inclusion, well done</td>', 'The extra sky on the left really works to give the building a sense of presence, the lamp serves to provide an almost ironic illusion of lighting the building - very creative inclusion, well done', '2004-10-22 03:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
