(970367, 112168, 93, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this shot is really out of focus, and the light in the ghost is really over-exposed.  If using a non-assisted AF is your problem, then sometimes it can be helpful to carry a bright flashlight around with you to help with the auto-focusing, especially at night and with darker subjects.  Also, I find that this photograph is pretty plain and simple (simplicity isn''t always a bad thing though, it''s just really hard to capture in a nice way), and lacking in any strong compositional area.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this shot is really out of focus, and the light in the ghost is really over-exposed.  If using a non-assisted AF is your problem, then sometimes it can be helpful to carry a bright flashlight around with you to help with the auto-focusing, especially at night and with darker subjects.  Also, I find that this photograph is pretty plain and simple (simplicity isn''t always a bad thing though, it''s just really hard to capture in a nice way), and lacking in any strong compositional area.', '2004-10-23 01:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(970368, 112544, 93, '<td valign="top">Far too dark for my tastes. This shot needed a bit more exposure, and some stronger contrast.  Also, it looks like it may be a "night for day" shot.. meaning it was taken during the day, but given a dark cast.  If that''s not the case, my mistake, but to be honest, that''s what it looks like to me.</td>', 'Far too dark for my tastes. This shot needed a bit more exposure, and some stronger contrast.  Also, it looks like it may be a "night for day" shot.. meaning it was taken during the day, but given a dark cast.  If that''s not the case, my mistake, but to be honest, that''s what it looks like to me.', '2004-10-23 01:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(970371, 113581, 93, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.. because, to me, it looks like you were taking this hand-held with too long a shutter speed, or, if you were using a tripod, it was very windy.<br/> <br/>The light on the center of the church is also far over-exposed, and it hurts the rest of the shot.   Change these two elements, and you have a much nicer photograph.</td>', 'Out of focus.. because, to me, it looks like you were taking this hand-held with too long a shutter speed, or, if you were using a tripod, it was very windy. The light on the center of the church is also far over-exposed, and it hurts the rest of the shot.   Change these two elements, and you have a much nicer photograph.', '2004-10-23 02:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(970372, 113649, 93, '<td valign="top">Far too dark, with no solid subject, and no point of interest.</td>', 'Far too dark, with no solid subject, and no point of interest.', '2004-10-23 02:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(970373, 112992, 93, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, you really needed to find a different viewpoint for this.  The trees are just in the way, instead of being a strong compositional focus, and the subject matter of the title, (the supposed cottage), is hard to make out, lost in the clutter.<br/>Also, it''s overexposed.   The lighting is nice and eerie.. but.. that''s all you have, and it''s just not enough.</td>', 'In my opinion, you really needed to find a different viewpoint for this.  The trees are just in the way, instead of being a strong compositional focus, and the subject matter of the title, (the supposed cottage), is hard to make out, lost in the clutter.Also, it''s overexposed.   The lighting is nice and eerie.. but.. that''s all you have, and it''s just not enough.', '2004-10-23 02:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(970375, 113635, 93, '<td valign="top">This is an OK shot, but nothing spectacular.  More lighting to accentuate the pumpkin itself would have been better, and you possibly needed a little more background in order to shot the "night" aspect.  You have a Trio of pumpkins there.. which would have made a great triptych model.. but you chose to single out one, and for me, it''s turned this into a weaker photograph.</td>', 'This is an OK shot, but nothing spectacular.  More lighting to accentuate the pumpkin itself would have been better, and you possibly needed a little more background in order to shot the "night" aspect.  You have a Trio of pumpkins there.. which would have made a great triptych model.. but you chose to single out one, and for me, it''s turned this into a weaker photograph.', '2004-10-23 02:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(970379, 113062, 93, '<td valign="top">This one is just a little too dark on the Telescope for me.  I had to look at it for a little too long to even determine what it was, and that''s going to work against you for the majority of voting.  Another quick, diffused light source on the left side would have done wonders.</td>', 'This one is just a little too dark on the Telescope for me.  I had to look at it for a little too long to even determine what it was, and that''s going to work against you for the majority of voting.  Another quick, diffused light source on the left side would have done wonders.', '2004-10-23 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(970384, 113398, 93, '<td valign="top">The lens flares hurt this photo, and the fact that your title gives the impression of a subject, but the photograph doesn''t support it, (the beetle is hardly your focus in this photograph.), doesn''t help it either.  Had you gotten closer to the beetle, effectively cutting out the powerful parking lot light in the top right corner, and cut the exposure down a little, it would have been a better shot.  Still not great however, as a photograph of a car in a parking lot alone.. isn''t going to be the most stunning of subject choices.</td>', 'The lens flares hurt this photo, and the fact that your title gives the impression of a subject, but the photograph doesn''t support it, (the beetle is hardly your focus in this photograph.), doesn''t help it either.  Had you gotten closer to the beetle, effectively cutting out the powerful parking lot light in the top right corner, and cut the exposure down a little, it would have been a better shot.  Still not great however, as a photograph of a car in a parking lot alone.. isn''t going to be the most stunning of subject choices.', '2004-10-23 02:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(970386, 113485, 93, '<td valign="top">Hard to tie this one in to the challenge, and the subject matter, while colorful, is a little flat and uninteresting.</td>', 'Hard to tie this one in to the challenge, and the subject matter, while colorful, is a little flat and uninteresting.', '2004-10-23 02:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(970388, 113348, 93, '<td valign="top">This is quite a dynamic photo.  I''ve seen others like it, but it''s always neat to see someone take a new path with old material.  I love that I can see in the car and the dashboard, and the green tinting to the street-lights is very..  unique. Especially with the blue.  Great idea, nice execution.</td>', 'This is quite a dynamic photo.  I''ve seen others like it, but it''s always neat to see someone take a new path with old material.  I love that I can see in the car and the dashboard, and the green tinting to the street-lights is very..  unique. Especially with the blue.  Great idea, nice execution.', '2004-10-23 02:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(970390, 113385, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  Would that all of us could be near something spectacular to shoot when a challenge comes up :)</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  Would that all of us could be near something spectacular to shoot when a challenge comes up :)', '2004-10-23 02:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(970392, 112717, 93, '<td valign="top">Easily my favorite of the challenge. You''ve found a great mood with the lighting, and the shot is simple, yet effective.  The shadow cast by the stair-case adds just that little extra element, and the gradient from left to right is fantastic.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Easily my favorite of the challenge. You''ve found a great mood with the lighting, and the shot is simple, yet effective.  The shadow cast by the stair-case adds just that little extra element, and the gradient from left to right is fantastic. ', '2004-10-23 02:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(970394, 113647, 93, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a lower score at first, but kept coming back to it.  One of the better shots in my book now.. it uses some great lines and shadow, and the clarity is absolutely brilliant.  Looks like it was taken with quite a wide-angle lens, which was a great choice. (Although some may dock points for the curvature of the stairs at the bottom, which I like).   Wonderful photo.</td>', 'I gave this shot a lower score at first, but kept coming back to it.  One of the better shots in my book now.. it uses some great lines and shadow, and the clarity is absolutely brilliant.  Looks like it was taken with quite a wide-angle lens, which was a great choice. (Although some may dock points for the curvature of the stairs at the bottom, which I like).   Wonderful photo.', '2004-10-23 02:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(970395, 112357, 93, '<td valign="top">This photograph has a great feel to it.. a sombre, yet soothing mood.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This photograph has a great feel to it.. a sombre, yet soothing mood. ', '2004-10-23 02:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(970396, 113519, 93, '<td valign="top">Great, unique shot for the challenge.  The lightting is superb, and the effect very ghostly and haunting.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great, unique shot for the challenge.  The lightting is superb, and the effect very ghostly and haunting. ', '2004-10-23 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(970401, 113429, 15397, '<td valign="top">This picture is so beautifully taken.. however, I personally think that it is a bit bright...</td>', 'This picture is so beautifully taken.. however, I personally think that it is a bit bright...', '2004-10-23 02:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(970414, 112357, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow, how''d you do it?  Moonlight?  I really like this one - 9.</td>', 'Wow, how''d you do it?  Moonlight?  I really like this one - 9.', '2004-10-23 02:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(970595, 113624, 22781, '<td valign="top">Here''s my normal comment finaly:<br/>Very moody low key photo. I like it.<br/>I vote you 9, not ten because of the folowing reasons:<br/>1. A bit of the girls forehead and background behind the top of her head are blown out.<br/>2. Doesn''t scream Night Shot to me.<br/> <br/>Well 9 isn''t a bad score is it?</td>', 'Here''s my normal comment finaly:Very moody low key photo. I like it.I vote you 9, not ten because of the folowing reasons:1. A bit of the girls forehead and background behind the top of her head are blown out.2. Doesn''t scream Night Shot to me. Well 9 isn''t a bad score is it?', '2004-10-23 08:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(970599, 113691, 22781, '<td valign="top">A different view on this challenge. <br/>Dangerous.... People won''t get it.<br/> <br/>Like it (7)</td>', 'A different view on this challenge. Dangerous.... People won''t get it. Like it (7)', '2004-10-23 08:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
