(970763, 113507, 25742, '<td valign="top">good try.</td>', 'good try.', '2004-10-23 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(970772, 113385, 17103, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is about this one I like so much.  Very unreal feel to it, I suppose because of the red sky, which is just lovely.  The placement of the wheel in the frame is terrific, along with the strange angle.  Very nice!</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is about this one I like so much.  Very unreal feel to it, I suppose because of the red sky, which is just lovely.  The placement of the wheel in the frame is terrific, along with the strange angle.  Very nice!', '2004-10-23 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(970776, 113652, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is stunning, and the subject matter is dfiferent, which is good!  :)  I love the way the ambient light is reflecting off the right side of the lighthouse.  And of course the sky and clouds are very trippy.  Good luck in the challenge, I hope this one does well! - 9.</td>', 'This is stunning, and the subject matter is dfiferent, which is good!  :)  I love the way the ambient light is reflecting off the right side of the lighthouse.  And of course the sky and clouds are very trippy.  Good luck in the challenge, I hope this one does well! - 9.', '2004-10-23 13:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(970790, 113674, 5354, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, dangerous, really does have a feel of danger in there. I like it. This has made me think about some of the places I could go to get graphic, dark images. Thanks<br/> <br/>My top score by the way !!</td>', 'Mmmm, dangerous, really does have a feel of danger in there. I like it. This has made me think about some of the places I could go to get graphic, dark images. Thanks My top score by the way !!', '2004-10-23 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(970791, 112717, 5354, '<td valign="top">Excellent, very graphic, almost abstract. Got to be a ribbon if you ask me.</td>', 'Excellent, very graphic, almost abstract. Got to be a ribbon if you ask me.', '2004-10-23 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(970792, 112927, 5354, '<td valign="top">So clear and sharp, wonderful. I would appreciate knowing what equipment you used to get this, and waht technique you used to get the tonal range so perfect.</td>', 'So clear and sharp, wonderful. I would appreciate knowing what equipment you used to get this, and waht technique you used to get the tonal range so perfect.', '2004-10-23 13:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
