(970934, 113167, 4267, '<td valign="top">man... if you could just get the brightness/contrast set so the edge of the statue would blend in more with the sky and be invisible... that would be really great! otherwise still a nice shot</td>', 'man... if you could just get the brightness/contrast set so the edge of the statue would blend in more with the sky and be invisible... that would be really great! otherwise still a nice shot', '2004-10-23 16:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
