(971340, 113666, 20754, '<td valign="top">A lovely placid exposure...I admittedly tend to have a bias toward tighter crops and in this shot I would only wish that the last left inch were cropped off to give the bridgework a bolder spanning feel/look..leaving it in there weakens the overall impact for myself....but ther than that what a great shot! :)</td>', 'A lovely placid exposure...I admittedly tend to have a bias toward tighter crops and in this shot I would only wish that the last left inch were cropped off to give the bridgework a bolder spanning feel/look..leaving it in there weakens the overall impact for myself....but ther than that what a great shot! :)', '2004-10-24 00:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(971350, 113652, 15891, '<td valign="top">This photograph is just beautiful! If it doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be very surprised. But if for some reason it doesn''t (it''s been known to happen on DPC) at least you know that you captured a truly compelling image that will bring you satisfaction longer than winning ever could. Kudos!</td>', 'This photograph is just beautiful! If it doesn''t ribbon, I''ll be very surprised. But if for some reason it doesn''t (it''s been known to happen on DPC) at least you know that you captured a truly compelling image that will bring you satisfaction longer than winning ever could. Kudos!', '2004-10-24 01:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(971352, 113142, 15891, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the border on this photo but otherwise it is wonderful! I love the vintage look and lookie at that noise! Good for you for not neat-imaging the dickens out of it as the grain really adds to the image. Excellent job! Gave it a 9; bumping to a 10.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the border on this photo but otherwise it is wonderful! I love the vintage look and lookie at that noise! Good for you for not neat-imaging the dickens out of it as the grain really adds to the image. Excellent job! Gave it a 9; bumping to a 10.', '2004-10-24 01:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(971356, 113536, 15891, '<td valign="top">Is this in New Orleans? No matter - it is a wonderful shot. I like the use of the star filter here (assuming) and I like the simplicity. Maybe a hair too much noise reduction for my personal taste but since it''s not my shot, who am I to tell you what you should have done? I just think a touch of grain would have lent this image more realism. Good job :-)</td>', 'Is this in New Orleans? No matter - it is a wonderful shot. I like the use of the star filter here (assuming) and I like the simplicity. Maybe a hair too much noise reduction for my personal taste but since it''s not my shot, who am I to tell you what you should have done? I just think a touch of grain would have lent this image more realism. Good job :-)', '2004-10-24 01:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(971361, 113624, 15891, '<td valign="top">This is sooo "Interview with a Vampire"! Is this a girlgirlgirl shot? Regardless, I have really enjoyed viewing it and the image does an excellent job of conveying a dark and sultry melody. I can hear it in the background... Good job! Gave it an 8; bumped it to a 9.</td>', 'This is sooo "Interview with a Vampire"! Is this a girlgirlgirl shot? Regardless, I have really enjoyed viewing it and the image does an excellent job of conveying a dark and sultry melody. I can hear it in the background... Good job! Gave it an 8; bumped it to a 9.', '2004-10-24 01:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
