(971461, 113695, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is just my opinion, so take this with a grain of salt, but I think this would have been much better without the lit ground so prominent... Had you been able to isolate just the tree being lit with the black background (from a much lower perspective for instance), I feel this would have been much stronger.  Of course it would be a completely different shot, and not what you were going for... So, pay no attention to me :)</td>', 'This is just my opinion, so take this with a grain of salt, but I think this would have been much better without the lit ground so prominent... Had you been able to isolate just the tree being lit with the black background (from a much lower perspective for instance), I feel this would have been much stronger.  Of course it would be a completely different shot, and not what you were going for... So, pay no attention to me :)', '2004-10-24 03:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(971462, 113600, 2337, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t wild about this at first, but it''s grown on me quite a bit...  The focus is a bit soft, maybe because of a long exposure and a breeze... But I like the range :)</td>', 'I wasn''t wild about this at first, but it''s grown on me quite a bit...  The focus is a bit soft, maybe because of a long exposure and a breeze... But I like the range :)', '2004-10-24 03:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
