(971664, 113582, 27562, '<td valign="top">Really strong image.  Sharp focus and interesting composition.  However the red border is distracting and takes away from the image.</td>', 'Really strong image.  Sharp focus and interesting composition.  However the red border is distracting and takes away from the image.', '2004-10-24 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(971665, 113579, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very pretty building and even prettier at night.  I would like to see more detail on the steeples (maybe it''s my monitor, but don''t think so...?).  There also seems to be noisy/blotchy yellow on the center of the building and near that door.  Maybe try to blend the color a little...maybe with a slight blur?  A very nice image though.</td>', 'Very pretty building and even prettier at night.  I would like to see more detail on the steeples (maybe it''s my monitor, but don''t think so...?).  There also seems to be noisy/blotchy yellow on the center of the building and near that door.  Maybe try to blend the color a little...maybe with a slight blur?  A very nice image though.', '2004-10-24 12:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(971668, 113641, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of looking up at the cross, however I would have included more of the base of the cross because this looks more like a plus sign.  Maybe a tall comp. and moving (yourself) to the left to get a full shot would work better; not sure I like the roof in the bottom corner.  Still a good eye for noticing the ''blood''.  I would have missed that.</td>', 'I like the angle of looking up at the cross, however I would have included more of the base of the cross because this looks more like a plus sign.  Maybe a tall comp. and moving (yourself) to the left to get a full shot would work better; not sure I like the roof in the bottom corner.  Still a good eye for noticing the ''blood''.  I would have missed that.', '2004-10-24 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(971669, 113589, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like how you were able to catch the beams of light shooting out from the top.  I like the man at the base because it really shows proportion.  Was the lighting on the man there or did you use a flashlight or headlights to illuminate him?  I would be interested in seeing this in color.  I''m usually partial to b&amp;w but I feel this is a little too dark/contrasty for me.  Could be my monitor...</td>', 'Nice job.  I like how you were able to catch the beams of light shooting out from the top.  I like the man at the base because it really shows proportion.  Was the lighting on the man there or did you use a flashlight or headlights to illuminate him?  I would be interested in seeing this in color.  I''m usually partial to b&w but I feel this is a little too dark/contrasty for me.  Could be my monitor...', '2004-10-24 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(971672, 113360, 12809, '<td valign="top">Traffic trails are always fun shots.  I don''t care for the exposure on this one  though.  The road is too blown out and the bg is too dark for me.  How long was the exposure?  Did you do it manually or did you use aperture priority and was the road wet?  Try this again on dry road and maybe not so close to overhead lighting...?  I do like the composition you chose, though.</td>', 'Traffic trails are always fun shots.  I don''t care for the exposure on this one  though.  The road is too blown out and the bg is too dark for me.  How long was the exposure?  Did you do it manually or did you use aperture priority and was the road wet?  Try this again on dry road and maybe not so close to overhead lighting...?  I do like the composition you chose, though.', '2004-10-24 13:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(971673, 113099, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject choice and comp.  Not a so-called "pretty picture" but I really like this.  Good comp. and exposure.  The post is actually very pretty itself.  Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting subject choice and comp.  Not a so-called "pretty picture" but I really like this.  Good comp. and exposure.  The post is actually very pretty itself.  Nice job.', '2004-10-24 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(971674, 113339, 12809, '<td valign="top">Pretty, soft colors.  I like their gradient and how the orange highlights your subject.  The moon is a nice addition.  I''m not sure how you could have done this different but I find the overlapping bridges a little overwhelming.  You can barely make out any one of them because of them overlapping.  Any chance you could try another location (higher/lower, closer/farther) to try and separate each bridge?  Maybe even tuck each of the farther away bridges under each closer one?  Nice job.  The colors are very appealing and I like it for that reason.</td>', 'Pretty, soft colors.  I like their gradient and how the orange highlights your subject.  The moon is a nice addition.  I''m not sure how you could have done this different but I find the overlapping bridges a little overwhelming.  You can barely make out any one of them because of them overlapping.  Any chance you could try another location (higher/lower, closer/farther) to try and separate each bridge?  Maybe even tuck each of the farther away bridges under each closer one?  Nice job.  The colors are very appealing and I like it for that reason.', '2004-10-24 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(971675, 112717, 12809, '<td valign="top">First shot so far that I''ve "wow''d" at.  This captures you right away.  It''s moody and intense.  I like the shadowplay, the orange tones and the crack in the wall.  Definitely like the hood for added mystery, too.   -8-</td>', 'First shot so far that I''ve "wow''d" at.  This captures you right away.  It''s moody and intense.  I like the shadowplay, the orange tones and the crack in the wall.  Definitely like the hood for added mystery, too.   -8-', '2004-10-24 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(971676, 113643, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like the recursion and the exposure.  Wish there was a way to clip off the left.  It tries to steal my attention from the subject.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like the recursion and the exposure.  Wish there was a way to clip off the left.  It tries to steal my attention from the subject.', '2004-10-24 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(971678, 113115, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice skyline shot.  Good exposure.  Did you play with the color in the sky?  The purple seems a bit unnatural to me but it could just be a reaction from the city lights below.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice skyline shot.  Good exposure.  Did you play with the color in the sky?  The purple seems a bit unnatural to me but it could just be a reaction from the city lights below.  Nice job.', '2004-10-24 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(971679, 112973, 12809, '<td valign="top">I would easily walk by this and miss this shot.  I really like the colors and comp.  Colors are soothing and the comp. leaves question as to what hotel/motel this is.  Good eye.</td>', 'I would easily walk by this and miss this shot.  I really like the colors and comp.  Colors are soothing and the comp. leaves question as to what hotel/motel this is.  Good eye.', '2004-10-24 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
