(971812, 113433, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed exposure, the picture benefits from having a bit of detail in the sky.</td>', 'Nicely timed exposure, the picture benefits from having a bit of detail in the sky.', '2004-10-24 16:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(971815, 112544, 14603, '<td valign="top">It will be interesting to see if this was taken at night or whether it`s a daytime shot that has been post processed to simulate nighttime. Either way, I like it.<br/>The subtle golden tones and excellent composition give it real character.<br/>Hope it`s not too dark for some voter`s monitors.</td>', 'It will be interesting to see if this was taken at night or whether it`s a daytime shot that has been post processed to simulate nighttime. Either way, I like it.The subtle golden tones and excellent composition give it real character.Hope it`s not too dark for some voter`s monitors.', '2004-10-24 16:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(971819, 113621, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of perspective.<br/>My personal preference in this type of shot is to keep the colour which emphasises the contrast between the cold grey of the metal and the warm yellows of the lights but that is only MY preference and doesn`t take away from the quality of the shot..Very nice work</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of perspective.My personal preference in this type of shot is to keep the colour which emphasises the contrast between the cold grey of the metal and the warm yellows of the lights but that is only MY preference and doesn`t take away from the quality of the shot..Very nice work', '2004-10-24 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(971821, 113386, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the bridges (Newcastle I presume from the title?)<br/>Well framed and exposed.</td>', 'Nice shot of the bridges (Newcastle I presume from the title?)Well framed and exposed.', '2004-10-24 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(971824, 112717, 8139, '<td valign="top">Colors,shadows,mood...a great shot</td>', 'Colors,shadows,mood...a great shot', '2004-10-24 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(971825, 113348, 8139, '<td valign="top">great dynamic shot.Cool colors.</td>', 'great dynamic shot.Cool colors.', '2004-10-24 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(971827, 113507, 14603, '<td valign="top">A nice colourful abstract, the type of image which all too often gets hammered on this site.<br/>Hope it does well.</td>', 'A nice colourful abstract, the type of image which all too often gets hammered on this site.Hope it does well.', '2004-10-24 16:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(971828, 113677, 27952, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Hope it does well.', '2004-10-24 16:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(971830, 112357, 8139, '<td valign="top">Dreamy indeed. Or nightmare?<br/>Great composition.</td>', 'Dreamy indeed. Or nightmare?Great composition.', '2004-10-24 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(971833, 113097, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and composed and surprisingly colourful for a night shot.<br/>Well captured.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and composed and surprisingly colourful for a night shot.Well captured.', '2004-10-24 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(971835, 113263, 8139, '<td valign="top">Great photo .</td>', 'Great photo .', '2004-10-24 16:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(971837, 113517, 28345, '<td valign="top">This is a great night shot. It also seems to have some sort of environmental message that I cant quite grasp</td>', 'This is a great night shot. It also seems to have some sort of environmental message that I cant quite grasp', '2004-10-24 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(971838, 112357, 28345, '<td valign="top">Amazing, it looks as though a city is rising from the ocean.</td>', 'Amazing, it looks as though a city is rising from the ocean.', '2004-10-24 16:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(971844, 113508, 27952, '<td valign="top">Lovely, well done on the contrast!</td>', 'Lovely, well done on the contrast!', '2004-10-24 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(971863, 113339, 17126, '<td valign="top">SO WEIRD! I''m wearing a Cooper River Bridge Run t-shirt right now from 1978!! It''s the 10k meter run that they used to have. AWESOME!!! I''d give it a 10 for the Charleston nostalgia, but I''m not a member...</td>', 'SO WEIRD! I''m wearing a Cooper River Bridge Run t-shirt right now from 1978!! It''s the 10k meter run that they used to have. AWESOME!!! I''d give it a 10 for the Charleston nostalgia, but I''m not a member...', '2004-10-24 17:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(971864, 113348, 17126, '<td valign="top">Insane! A perfect PERFECT shot!</td>', 'Insane! A perfect PERFECT shot!', '2004-10-24 17:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(971865, 113433, 17126, '<td valign="top">I love the borders. I wish the clouds didn''t have any noise. You can take care of that in photoshop by using the blurring brush tool at about 15-20%, or "despeckling" (i usually use the spot fixer brush tool to blur though because sometimes despeckle takes out needed detail).</td>', 'I love the borders. I wish the clouds didn''t have any noise. You can take care of that in photoshop by using the blurring brush tool at about 15-20%, or "despeckling" (i usually use the spot fixer brush tool to blur though because sometimes despeckle takes out needed detail).', '2004-10-24 17:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(971866, 113429, 17126, '<td valign="top">I declare this a winner. One of the coolest photographs I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'I declare this a winner. One of the coolest photographs I''ve ever seen.', '2004-10-24 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(971868, 113360, 17126, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot.', '2004-10-24 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(971870, 112640, 17126, '<td valign="top">An amazing place, but there are several things going on that shouldn''t be... A lot of distraction on the left (or the right, depending on what the main subject is supposed to bee here.)</td>', 'An amazing place, but there are several things going on that shouldn''t be... A lot of distraction on the left (or the right, depending on what the main subject is supposed to bee here.)', '2004-10-24 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(971877, 113507, 22781, '<td valign="top">I think you have been voted down by a lot of people because of this camera shake.<br/>It''s not realy attractive these kind of photo''s if there isnt a real pattern in the blur...<br/>I don''t se that around here, great tip: Tripod for x-mas....<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'I think you have been voted down by a lot of people because of this camera shake.It''s not realy attractive these kind of photo''s if there isnt a real pattern in the blur...I don''t se that around here, great tip: Tripod for x-mas.... Good luck.', '2004-10-24 18:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(971919, 113504, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-10-24 19:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(971920, 113652, 6130, '<td valign="top">So beautiful. 10</td>', 'So beautiful. 10', '2004-10-24 19:33:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(971921, 113658, 25143, '<td valign="top">nice and clean match to the modern scene depicted</td>', 'nice and clean match to the modern scene depicted', '2004-10-24 19:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(971931, 113663, 28428, '<td valign="top">i love this photo!! It''s magnificent!!!</td>', 'i love this photo!! It''s magnificent!!!', '2004-10-24 19:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(971932, 112940, 15497, '<td valign="top">One word: WOW! I really hope this photo wins. It''s very difficult to achive. 10</td>', 'One word: WOW! I really hope this photo wins. It''s very difficult to achive. 10', '2004-10-24 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(971933, 113433, 12362, '<td valign="top">I love Krakow, the light source in the right just gives me the medievil feel of this BEAUTIFUL city.  Very Impressed. 9</td>', 'I love Krakow, the light source in the right just gives me the medievil feel of this BEAUTIFUL city.  Very Impressed. 9', '2004-10-24 20:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(971936, 112357, 12362, '<td valign="top">W-O-W......<br/>Im speechless...<br/>10</td>', 'W-O-W......Im speechless...10', '2004-10-24 20:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(971943, 113366, 20754, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and bold colors of this shot...making a creative, appealing shot of a subject matter that typically isn''t thought of as such...the only minor drawbacks i  see are uneven noise/discolorization blotches in the sky (especially in the blue parts)....and there appears to be odd uneven blurriness in the armsection coming down attached to the shovel...not sure if it is uneven blur tool use or splotchy cloning but there is intermittent blur and sharpness intervals...otherwise a stunning powerful shot!</td>', 'I love the composition and bold colors of this shot...making a creative, appealing shot of a subject matter that typically isn''t thought of as such...the only minor drawbacks i  see are uneven noise/discolorization blotches in the sky (especially in the blue parts)....and there appears to be odd uneven blurriness in the armsection coming down attached to the shovel...not sure if it is uneven blur tool use or splotchy cloning but there is intermittent blur and sharpness intervals...otherwise a stunning powerful shot!', '2004-10-24 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(971945, 113517, 20754, '<td valign="top">I''m typically not a big fan of wide cityscape shots but this one has a gorgeous magical touch to it...the long shuttered smoke captures are simply lovely...I think the other streetlights are a bit too hot and overexposed but it doesn''t really detract at all from the serene beauty of the shot by much...great job!</td>', 'I''m typically not a big fan of wide cityscape shots but this one has a gorgeous magical touch to it...the long shuttered smoke captures are simply lovely...I think the other streetlights are a bit too hot and overexposed but it doesn''t really detract at all from the serene beauty of the shot by much...great job!', '2004-10-24 20:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(971947, 113672, 20754, '<td valign="top">excellent composition and exposure...i''m sure this stunner will do great..one of my faves!</td>', 'excellent composition and exposure...i''m sure this stunner will do great..one of my faves!', '2004-10-24 20:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(971949, 113600, 16301, '<td valign="top">Better focus would have improved this. I also don''t find the subject interesting...</td>', 'Better focus would have improved this. I also don''t find the subject interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(971950, 113167, 19134, '<td valign="top">This is a fine photo! Great shot. This one you should try to sell! 10</td>', 'This is a fine photo! Great shot. This one you should try to sell! 10', '2004-10-24 20:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(971952, 113507, 16301, '<td valign="top">Going for something abstract? I appriciate abstracts, this one just isn''t visually interesting...</td>', 'Going for something abstract? I appriciate abstracts, this one just isn''t visually interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(971954, 113649, 16301, '<td valign="top">Way too dark, I can only see some trees and grass, I just don''t find it interesting...</td>', 'Way too dark, I can only see some trees and grass, I just don''t find it interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(971955, 112168, 16301, '<td valign="top">I just don''t find the subject interesting...</td>', 'I just don''t find the subject interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(971956, 113680, 16301, '<td valign="top">I just don''t find the subject interesting...</td>', 'I just don''t find the subject interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(971960, 113696, 16301, '<td valign="top">I just don''t find this visually interesting...</td>', 'I just don''t find this visually interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(971961, 112942, 19134, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective. Great shot! 10</td>', 'I love the perspective. Great shot! 10', '2004-10-24 20:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(971962, 113599, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice glow on your sign, but the shot is way too busy, indistinct and disjointed to deliver an effective focal point. I would suggest getting closer to your intended subject to ensure that we look at what you want us to. I don''t see much of interest in any of the background and I also feel that I should take some ''meaning'' from the directional signs, but I don''t see one.</td>', 'Nice glow on your sign, but the shot is way too busy, indistinct and disjointed to deliver an effective focal point. I would suggest getting closer to your intended subject to ensure that we look at what you want us to. I don''t see much of interest in any of the background and I also feel that I should take some ''meaning'' from the directional signs, but I don''t see one.', '2004-10-24 20:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(971963, 113319, 7628, '<td valign="top">wonderful how you caught this owl with wing spread, I also like how the bend on the wing is mirrored in the loops of the vines on the tree.  But the flask really flattens the image - makes it hard to tell what is bird and what is tree.  I would like to see the bird contrast more with the tree.</td>', 'wonderful how you caught this owl with wing spread, I also like how the bend on the wing is mirrored in the loops of the vines on the tree.  But the flask really flattens the image - makes it hard to tell what is bird and what is tree.  I would like to see the bird contrast more with the tree.', '2004-10-24 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(971964, 113410, 16301, '<td valign="top">Maybe a view of the city scape in the background would have been more interesting, but I don''t know what the scene is, so I don''t find this visually interesting...</td>', 'Maybe a view of the city scape in the background would have been more interesting, but I don''t know what the scene is, so I don''t find this visually interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(971965, 113647, 19134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph! Top 10, you get a 10!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph! Top 10, you get a 10!', '2004-10-24 20:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(971967, 113099, 8860, '<td valign="top">Quite interesting subject, but the quirky angle appears to be a substitute for a creative execution.</td>', 'Quite interesting subject, but the quirky angle appears to be a substitute for a creative execution.', '2004-10-24 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(971968, 113398, 16301, '<td valign="top">Maybe exclude the VW? I just don''t find this photo interesting...</td>', 'Maybe exclude the VW? I just don''t find this photo interesting...', '2004-10-24 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(971969, 113495, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is magical - it has such a golden glow.  It really gives a sense of the colors of a city and night.  Good subject choice, lovely composition.  The building do seem harsh against that gentle sky?  Did you sharpen them or blur the sky?  Or is it just the contrats of the man-made with nature?</td>', 'This is magical - it has such a golden glow.  It really gives a sense of the colors of a city and night.  Good subject choice, lovely composition.  The building do seem harsh against that gentle sky?  Did you sharpen them or blur the sky?  Or is it just the contrats of the man-made with nature?', '2004-10-24 20:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(971970, 113117, 19134, '<td valign="top">Very neat photo! 10!</td>', 'Very neat photo! 10!', '2004-10-24 20:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(971971, 113517, 16301, '<td valign="top">The negative space in the bottom does nothing to the composition, I think it would have looked better if the subjects were lower in the frame, with more negative space at the top.</td>', 'The negative space in the bottom does nothing to the composition, I think it would have looked better if the subjects were lower in the frame, with more negative space at the top.', '2004-10-24 20:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(971972, 113305, 7628, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of old black and white movies - Its a WOnderful Life foreinstance.  The way the lights glow gives real atmosphere.  The composition is pretty straight forward - as simple as the small town.  I"d like to see a bit more to the right, so that vanishing point is really visible.</td>', 'This makes me think of old black and white movies - Its a WOnderful Life foreinstance.  The way the lights glow gives real atmosphere.  The composition is pretty straight forward - as simple as the small town.  I"d like to see a bit more to the right, so that vanishing point is really visible.', '2004-10-24 20:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(971974, 113398, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nothing to grab me here I''m afraid. The shot itself is a little noisy and softly focused, with some blown highlights. Your best bet would be to meter the shot on the brightest areas (or close to the brightest area) and pull some detail back from the shadows in Photoshop.</td>', 'Nothing to grab me here I''m afraid. The shot itself is a little noisy and softly focused, with some blown highlights. Your best bet would be to meter the shot on the brightest areas (or close to the brightest area) and pull some detail back from the shadows in Photoshop.', '2004-10-24 20:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(971976, 113674, 7628, '<td valign="top">Film Noir feel.  I like how the puddle takes up the whole bottom half of the composition as if it were its own world lying next to the real one,</td>', 'Film Noir feel.  I like how the puddle takes up the whole bottom half of the composition as if it were its own world lying next to the real one,', '2004-10-24 20:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(971977, 113349, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dynamic composition and strong colour. Well shot - but it would be nice to see a lone bowler or something to really cap off the shot.</td>', 'Dynamic composition and strong colour. Well shot - but it would be nice to see a lone bowler or something to really cap off the shot.', '2004-10-24 20:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(971980, 113363, 7628, '<td valign="top">THe street lights have created some interesting shadows - but it feels too bright to be night - okay I know that is a city for you!  There are some strange artifacts - as if this were sharpenned too much - odd stark lines of gray.</td>', 'THe street lights have created some interesting shadows - but it feels too bright to be night - okay I know that is a city for you!  There are some strange artifacts - as if this were sharpenned too much - odd stark lines of gray.', '2004-10-24 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(971981, 113466, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a lot going on here really - but the least I''d is to shoot low down or anything but eye-level which really makes the viewpoint quite dull. You good have got close to fire truck perhaps and shot the fireman with some of the shiny bodywork (incl the bell) in the foreground?</td>', 'Not a lot going on here really - but the least I''d is to shoot low down or anything but eye-level which really makes the viewpoint quite dull. You good have got close to fire truck perhaps and shot the fireman with some of the shiny bodywork (incl the bell) in the foreground?', '2004-10-24 20:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(971982, 113647, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint - good composition.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint - good composition.', '2004-10-24 20:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(971983, 113349, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ilike the colors - very neon and night-like.  I could see going even more abstract here with all the lights and reflections.  You needn''t include the forground - but perhaps the blur of some moving balls?</td>', 'Ilike the colors - very neon and night-like.  I could see going even more abstract here with all the lights and reflections.  You needn''t include the forground - but perhaps the blur of some moving balls?', '2004-10-24 20:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(971985, 113563, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pretty form and colour. Since this is abstract, I''d rather have seen the streaks bleeding out of shot which would quell the feeling of knowing someone was stood here with a torch! If I crop the edges with my hands it begins to look more powerful and intriguing.<br/> <br/>Some nice pulses in the streaks and it looks nicely exposed.</td>', 'Pretty form and colour. Since this is abstract, I''d rather have seen the streaks bleeding out of shot which would quell the feeling of knowing someone was stood here with a torch! If I crop the edges with my hands it begins to look more powerful and intriguing. Some nice pulses in the streaks and it looks nicely exposed.', '2004-10-24 20:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(971986, 113532, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ilike the sparkling wet texture and this color is perfect for night in the city.  The composition works well tho the image is busy - the line of the street and cars leads the eye easily into the picture from the bottom, and the line of the roofs leads you in from the top - creating a nice "x"</td>', 'Ilike the sparkling wet texture and this color is perfect for night in the city.  The composition works well tho the image is busy - the line of the street and cars leads the eye easily into the picture from the bottom, and the line of the roofs leads you in from the top - creating a nice "x"', '2004-10-24 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(971987, 113699, 8860, '<td valign="top">View is OK, but tilted horizon is just a distracting oversight really. Well composed otherwise.</td>', 'View is OK, but tilted horizon is just a distracting oversight really. Well composed otherwise.', '2004-10-24 20:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(971988, 112773, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong viewpoint, well composed. Perhaps a little uninteresting though.</td>', 'Strong viewpoint, well composed. Perhaps a little uninteresting though.', '2004-10-24 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(971989, 112657, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of movement and stillness, light and dark. Your shot really tells a story.  I like the hoorizontal lines - the fence, the water, the lights in the distance and the intersecting verticals - most strong the signpost and the still person.  There is both balance and tension.  10</td>', 'I love the contrast of movement and stillness, light and dark. Your shot really tells a story.  I like the hoorizontal lines - the fence, the water, the lights in the distance and the intersecting verticals - most strong the signpost and the still person.  There is both balance and tension.  10', '2004-10-24 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(971990, 113018, 8860, '<td valign="top">Moody sky, well composed.</td>', 'Moody sky, well composed.', '2004-10-24 20:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(971991, 113652, 7628, '<td valign="top">That sky is increadible.  The silent movement of the clouds at night.  I like how the colors are subtle - at night colors become indistinct.  The composition contracts the filmy horizontal movent of the sky, with the solid vertical of the lighthouse.  9</td>', 'That sky is increadible.  The silent movement of the clouds at night.  I like how the colors are subtle - at night colors become indistinct.  The composition contracts the filmy horizontal movent of the sky, with the solid vertical of the lighthouse.  9', '2004-10-24 20:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(971992, 113440, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and subject. Foreground distracting and looks better with the red stuff cropped out.</td>', 'Nice exposure and subject. Foreground distracting and looks better with the red stuff cropped out.', '2004-10-24 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(971994, 113565, 164, '<td valign="top">Could have been good but it is too hard to see what is going on.</td>', 'Could have been good but it is too hard to see what is going on.', '2004-10-24 20:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(971995, 113018, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this cropped a tiny bit on the bottom and more at the top to emphasise the line between the sky and the earth.  I like the small silouettes of the trees on the horizen and This would draw more attention to them.</td>', 'I''d like to see this cropped a tiny bit on the bottom and more at the top to emphasise the line between the sky and the earth.  I like the small silouettes of the trees on the horizen and This would draw more attention to them.', '2004-10-24 20:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(971997, 113386, 8860, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, well focused and composed.</td>', 'Crisp, clear, well focused and composed.', '2004-10-24 20:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(971998, 113607, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautifully mundane! Nice exposure.</td>', 'Beautifully mundane! Nice exposure.', '2004-10-24 20:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(971999, 113259, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the sparkle and the dark blue - the water mirrors the sky as it captures that perfect dark blue before blackness.  I might even crop the top a bit more to emphasize the reflections.  The dark band in the sky is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the sparkle and the dark blue - the water mirrors the sky as it captures that perfect dark blue before blackness.  I might even crop the top a bit more to emphasize the reflections.  The dark band in the sky is a bit distracting.', '2004-10-24 20:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(972000, 113688, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>Nothing more impressive than this in this challenge.</td>', 'returning for commentsNothing more impressive than this in this challenge.', '2004-10-24 20:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(972001, 113141, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smart shot and very weird. Great exposure and subject.</td>', 'Smart shot and very weird. Great exposure and subject.', '2004-10-24 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(972003, 113517, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fabulous motion and color.  The subtle shapes and gradients in the drakness detract from the bursts above I''d crop from the bottom and just the leaves a lin black line at the btoom withe the silhouettes on the trees.</td>', 'Fabulous motion and color.  The subtle shapes and gradients in the drakness detract from the bursts above I''d crop from the bottom and just the leaves a lin black line at the btoom withe the silhouettes on the trees.', '2004-10-24 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(972004, 113167, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great subject and exposure. Composition looks a little weak to me though. I''m sure there could have been a more interesting viewpoint.</td>', 'Great subject and exposure. Composition looks a little weak to me though. I''m sure there could have been a more interesting viewpoint.', '2004-10-24 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(972007, 113108, 26362, '<td valign="top">I really love this,  and I''m interested in finding out how you did it! One of my favorites of the challenge... both simple and striking at the same time.</td>', 'I really love this,  and I''m interested in finding out how you did it! One of my favorites of the challenge... both simple and striking at the same time.', '2004-10-24 20:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(972008, 113266, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very simple and very smart.</td>', 'Very simple and very smart.', '2004-10-24 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(972009, 113348, 7628, '<td valign="top">dynamic and abstract - love the green and yellow.  There is less visual meaning and more emotional - the speed, the lines on a city, the colors and adventure of night. 9</td>', 'dynamic and abstract - love the green and yellow.  There is less visual meaning and more emotional - the speed, the lines on a city, the colors and adventure of night. 9', '2004-10-24 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(972010, 112940, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very striking shot. Great idea with some lovely features to see.</td>', 'Very striking shot. Great idea with some lovely features to see.', '2004-10-24 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
