(972021, 113504, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great composition and excellent subject. The highlight''s a bit annoying and it looks a tad oversharpened (try converting to Lab colour in PS and sharpening just the Lightness channel which prevents haloing of the colours) which is made more noticeable with a night shot. <br/> <br/>I love your forground here - inspired.</td>', 'Great composition and excellent subject. The highlight''s a bit annoying and it looks a tad oversharpened (try converting to Lab colour in PS and sharpening just the Lightness channel which prevents haloing of the colours) which is made more noticeable with a night shot.  I love your forground here - inspired.', '2004-10-24 21:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
