(972068, 113452, 4877, '<td valign="top">I like your photo.  Great reflections and exposure.<br/> <br/>I think something that would give your photo more impact would be to zoom in on the buildings to the right and fill the frame a little more.  The lights to the left of the image are interesting, but I think detract slightly from the overall shot.  <br/> <br/>The black space works well, but perhaps a little too well.  <br/> <br/>Experiment with your shooting location and perspective.<br/> <br/>You''ve got a great eye, and a talent for night photography.  Keep it up!</td>', 'I like your photo.  Great reflections and exposure. I think something that would give your photo more impact would be to zoom in on the buildings to the right and fill the frame a little more.  The lights to the left of the image are interesting, but I think detract slightly from the overall shot.   The black space works well, but perhaps a little too well.   Experiment with your shooting location and perspective. You''ve got a great eye, and a talent for night photography.  Keep it up!', '2004-10-24 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
