(972354, 113259, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  16th and 6.526 average score!  Both are personal bests for me so far.  Thanks to all who commented.  This site is great and keeps making me get better.  Feels good to make the old 2 MP camera work.</td>', 'Wow!  16th and 6.526 average score!  Both are personal bests for me so far.  Thanks to all who commented.  This site is great and keeps making me get better.  Feels good to make the old 2 MP camera work.', '2004-10-25 01:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
