(972586, 113097, 14603, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by andrewlr:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey!<br/> <br/>I''m really sorry to hear about this expensive shot!  That sucks!<br/> <br/>Great capture.  Hope you can get some more gear soon.<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work!<br/> <br/>Andrew </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I second that..what a sickener.<br/> <br/>I had a wee feeling this might be you. I was sure I had seen an image a while back taken at a place like this (although from a totally different viewpoint.)<br/>I couldn`t remember if it was from you or Ed (E301.)<br/>Would that be right?<br/> <br/>Found it.."Gridlines and glass" ..same place ??<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-25 07:46:46.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by andrewlr: Hey! I''m really sorry to hear about this expensive shot!  That sucks! Great capture.  Hope you can get some more gear soon. Keep up the great work! Andrew  I second that..what a sickener. I had a wee feeling this might be you. I was sure I had seen an image a while back taken at a place like this (although from a totally different viewpoint.)I couldn`t remember if it was from you or Ed (E301.)Would that be right? Found it.."Gridlines and glass" ..same place ??', '2004-10-25 05:26:53.000000', '2004-10-25 08:46:46.000000', 0),
(972587, 113532, 14603, '<td valign="top">Really good shot Paul.it captures the "Coronation st" mood very well.</td>', 'Really good shot Paul.it captures the "Coronation st" mood very well.', '2004-10-25 05:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(972590, 112357, 16004, '<td valign="top">i have absolutely nothing to add to my previous comment, only to say that bloody well done on a totally completely deserved ribbon.  this is completely gorgeous and beautiful and totally inspired.</td>', 'i have absolutely nothing to add to my previous comment, only to say that bloody well done on a totally completely deserved ribbon.  this is completely gorgeous and beautiful and totally inspired.', '2004-10-25 05:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(972597, 113517, 14603, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments folks.<br/>I totally understand why the composition doesn`t suit all...it wasn`t my first choice either..however, it is extremely difficult to get shots of the refinery now without being subjected to police involvement.so this was taken about a mile away in a very muddy, dark,farmers field.<br/>I got there took two or three shots and got out again before anyone could pass by. The picture you see has had a little cropped off the bottom to centre the refinery. I tried all types of crop and to get the crop most people suggest meant zooming in on the refinery and I didn`t feel the image was sharp enough for that..so decided on the central composition as the lesser of all evils.<br/>If I hadn`t been so panicky about getting caught taking the picture, I would have had taken more time to think about my composition and not relied on trying to sort it out afterwards.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments folks.I totally understand why the composition doesn`t suit all...it wasn`t my first choice either..however, it is extremely difficult to get shots of the refinery now without being subjected to police involvement.so this was taken about a mile away in a very muddy, dark,farmers field.I got there took two or three shots and got out again before anyone could pass by. The picture you see has had a little cropped off the bottom to centre the refinery. I tried all types of crop and to get the crop most people suggest meant zooming in on the refinery and I didn`t feel the image was sharp enough for that..so decided on the central composition as the lesser of all evils.If I hadn`t been so panicky about getting caught taking the picture, I would have had taken more time to think about my composition and not relied on trying to sort it out afterwards.', '2004-10-25 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(972602, 113097, 25486, '<td valign="top">Bloody hell, what a kick in the guts!<br/> <br/>There was me fretting because I almost lost my monopod at the weekend.  Returned to the field where I left it the next day and it was still there.  Any chance you can claim on insurance?<br/> <br/>Hope it doesn''t stop you producing more great work.</td>', 'Bloody hell, what a kick in the guts! There was me fretting because I almost lost my monopod at the weekend.  Returned to the field where I left it the next day and it was still there.  Any chance you can claim on insurance? Hope it doesn''t stop you producing more great work.', '2004-10-25 06:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
