(972665, 113533, 7889, '<td valign="top">Hi Tom, I did not have time to comment during the challenge, only had time to vote. This is an excellent photograph. I did expect it to finish in the top 10 but I should have known better. I believe that a lot of people only think a photograph is ''good'' if everything is in focus, they seem incapable to see beyond this. Its one aspect of this site that dissapoints me very much. You have a very good eye and great talent. I look forward to more of the same from you.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi Tom, I did not have time to comment during the challenge, only had time to vote. This is an excellent photograph. I did expect it to finish in the top 10 but I should have known better. I believe that a lot of people only think a photograph is ''good'' if everything is in focus, they seem incapable to see beyond this. Its one aspect of this site that dissapoints me very much. You have a very good eye and great talent. I look forward to more of the same from you. Mike ', '2004-10-25 08:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
