(972672, 112544, 24642, '<td valign="top">I find it tragic that brilliant low key photograph such as yours get such a low score, this happens over and over.  The quality of this image is tremendous, the tone, the composition of the boat and the shore pointing to the main subject. I also love the shots which I assume are from the same night.  <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=115116" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115116.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115116.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115116.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=115116" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115115.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115115.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/2217/thumb/115115.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-25 17:36:55.</i></td>', 'I find it tragic that brilliant low key photograph such as yours get such a low score, this happens over and over.  The quality of this image is tremendous, the tone, the composition of the boat and the shore pointing to the main subject. I also love the shots which I assume are from the same night.     Keep up the good work.', '2004-10-25 08:34:01.000000', '2004-10-25 18:36:55.000000', 0),
