(972692, 113504, 10390, '<td valign="top">Where''s that piece of paper... oh, here it is... uuuhummm...<br/> <br/>"Dear fellow DPCers<br/> <br/>I want to thank my country, Iceland, to be placed on the top of the world, the northern winter for the aurora, my family for tolerating my addiction to this hobby..." bla bla blahhh<br/> <br/>hahaha, what can I say, WOW!  I''m speechless... MANY THANKS!<br/></td>', 'Where''s that piece of paper... oh, here it is... uuuhummm... "Dear fellow DPCers I want to thank my country, Iceland, to be placed on the top of the world, the northern winter for the aurora, my family for tolerating my addiction to this hobby..." bla bla blahhh hahaha, what can I say, WOW!  I''m speechless... MANY THANKS!', '2004-10-25 09:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
