(972705, 113519, 25150, '<td valign="top">I''m really dissapointed that this was scored so low. I am one of the 4 to give you a 9. I wish people would vote on photographic difficulty, quality, and integrity. This displays all three and deserves at least a top 20 finish, if not a top 10.</td>', 'I''m really dissapointed that this was scored so low. I am one of the 4 to give you a 9. I wish people would vote on photographic difficulty, quality, and integrity. This displays all three and deserves at least a top 20 finish, if not a top 10.', '2004-10-25 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
