(972725, 113659, 24789, '<td valign="top">Greetings all,<br/>    Thanks for the votes, and especially the two comments, I went out the night after the entry deadline had past and re-shot this picture, I think the reshoot came out a hell of a lot better and would love to know what others think....<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=115403" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24789/thumb/115403.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24789/thumb/115403.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/24789/thumb/115403.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Mike<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-26 14:43:52.</i></td>', 'Greetings all,    Thanks for the votes, and especially the two comments, I went out the night after the entry deadline had past and re-shot this picture, I think the reshoot came out a hell of a lot better and would love to know what others think....   Mike', '2004-10-25 09:59:12.000000', '2004-10-26 15:43:52.000000', 0),
