(972779, 113305, 10413, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this was yours.  I had another one picked to be yours in this challenge.  This was one of my favorites and I am surprised it didn''t get higher.  You beat me by 3 on this one, I think mine came in 36.  Beautiful shot Judith!</td>', 'I can''t believe this was yours.  I had another one picked to be yours in this challenge.  This was one of my favorites and I am surprised it didn''t get higher.  You beat me by 3 on this one, I think mine came in 36.  Beautiful shot Judith!', '2004-10-25 11:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
