(972909, 113581, 772, '<td valign="top">When you indicated to me that you had used a tripod for this photo, there is one additional step you can take to help eliminate the issue of camera shake...  Use the camera''s self timer to make the photo rather than pressing the shutter button.  This will eliminate any vibration in the camera that you could produce by touching it...  just an extra thought.</td>', 'When you indicated to me that you had used a tripod for this photo, there is one additional step you can take to help eliminate the issue of camera shake...  Use the camera''s self timer to make the photo rather than pressing the shutter button.  This will eliminate any vibration in the camera that you could produce by touching it...  just an extra thought.', '2004-10-25 12:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
