(973087, 113348, 27482, '<td valign="top">You are insane in my opinion.  Just plain insane.  I could never hang out my baby out on the outside of a car like that, sheesh, what if something happened?  I could never forgive myself.<br/> <br/>By the way, the shot is also insane, would have given it a 10 if I could have voted and no offense to Amason I think this should have won.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-25 13:48:04.</i></td>', 'You are insane in my opinion.  Just plain insane.  I could never hang out my baby out on the outside of a car like that, sheesh, what if something happened?  I could never forgive myself. By the way, the shot is also insane, would have given it a 10 if I could have voted and no offense to Amason I think this should have won.', '2004-10-25 14:47:44.000000', '2004-10-25 14:48:04.000000', 0),
(973116, 113504, 25742, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue<br/> <br/>Like the Angelica in the FG and the lighthouse is real nice.<br/> <br/>What lens were you using? <br/> <br/>I was thinking about the same, but couldn''t find any Northern Lights in my free nights that week. I have some nice one form one week before, and will hopefully find some tonight. They don''t seem to have been very strong that night, but the night sky is beautifully starlit.<br/></td>', 'Congratulations on your blue Like the Angelica in the FG and the lighthouse is real nice. What lens were you using?  I was thinking about the same, but couldn''t find any Northern Lights in my free nights that week. I have some nice one form one week before, and will hopefully find some tonight. They don''t seem to have been very strong that night, but the night sky is beautifully starlit.', '2004-10-25 15:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(973191, 113582, 20210, '<td valign="top">Very dissappointed to not see this shot do better.  I think it''s fantastic, great dynamic range, good composition, and so sharp for the smoke.  I also don''t dig the red frame, but still gave this shot an 8.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Very dissappointed to not see this shot do better.  I think it''s fantastic, great dynamic range, good composition, and so sharp for the smoke.  I also don''t dig the red frame, but still gave this shot an 8.  Keep it up!', '2004-10-25 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 0),
