(973617, 112275, 4877, '<td valign="top">Hi everyone,<br/> <br/>Thanks so much for all your comments!  Really enjoyed getting back into the challenges after a year''s break!<br/> <br/>Andrew</td>', 'Hi everyone, Thanks so much for all your comments!  Really enjoyed getting back into the challenges after a year''s break! Andrew', '2004-10-25 21:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(973659, 112927, 3724, '<td valign="top">I usually observe this familiar copper/bronze clad Saint Paul structure as part of the skyline, this night view up close from across Summit Ave is very good.  I love the rich b&amp;w rendering you have made which brings memories of the few times I visited it for special Christmas concerts with my father -  to attend the symphony/w choir to hear Handel.  A great local landmark both outside and in.  Very good work.</td>', 'I usually observe this familiar copper/bronze clad Saint Paul structure as part of the skyline, this night view up close from across Summit Ave is very good.  I love the rich b&w rendering you have made which brings memories of the few times I visited it for special Christmas concerts with my father -  to attend the symphony/w choir to hear Handel.  A great local landmark both outside and in.  Very good work.', '2004-10-25 21:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(973668, 113167, 25952, '<td valign="top">i work printing pics in the suburbs of chicago and i dunno how many pics have come through of millenium park. I need to get down there. best take in it i''ve seen yet. might''ve benefitted from a tigher crop though?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-25 20:46:38.</i></td>', 'i work printing pics in the suburbs of chicago and i dunno how many pics have come through of millenium park. I need to get down there. best take in it i''ve seen yet. might''ve benefitted from a tigher crop though?', '2004-10-25 21:42:52.000000', '2004-10-25 21:46:38.000000', 0),
