(1228480, 113536, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot, darren.  you might consider going back and shooting it at f/22 with a long (20-30 second) exposure.  you''ll be surprised at how much more detail comes out in the brick work.  also, at iso 100, there shouldn''t be that much noise as to detract from the atmosphere the grain would add.</td>', 'this is a nice shot, darren.  you might consider going back and shooting it at f/22 with a long (20-30 second) exposure.  you''ll be surprised at how much more detail comes out in the brick work.  also, at iso 100, there shouldn''t be that much noise as to detract from the atmosphere the grain would add.', '2005-03-15 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
